Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.19,0:03:21.51,Title,0,0,0,0,,《超人总动员2》
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.49,0:35:09.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎回来 弹力女超人 屏霸）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.89,0:49:25.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（屏霸仍然逍遥法外）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.70,0:16:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 超能先生 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Incredible ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:17:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 把坏人抓住 砰 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Catching the bad guys Pow, pow, pow ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.45,0:17:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 酷冰侠 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Frozone ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.02,0:17:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 酷冰侠 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Frozone ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.33,0:26:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 弹力女超人来了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Here comes Elastigirl ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.66,0:26:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 弹力弹弹弹 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Stretching her ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.91,0:00:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,机密档案 82-712\N{\fnArial\fs30}File 82-712.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪瑞克警官正在进行询问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Rick Dicker interrogating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:00:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说出你的姓名\N{\fnArial\fs30}State your name, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 托尼 托尼·莱丁格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Tony. Tony Rydinger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about the incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.69,0:01:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 有一个女孩 他是我们班的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's this girl, um, in my class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.93,0:01:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在运动会上看到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw her at the track meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是巴小倩对吧 - 是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're, uh, Violet, right? - That's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也认识她 可她变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sort of knew her, but she'd changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.23,0:01:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像更放松也更自信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relaxed. She was more sure of herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.57,0:01:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很酷 很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool, cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.84,0:01:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就约她去看电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked her out to a movie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就周五见\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Friday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 周五见 - 周五见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Friday. - Friday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.84,0:01:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就去看运动会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I went to watch the track meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,再后来 停车场里就出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not long after, this thing happened in the parking lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是 暗中破坏王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold! The Underminer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.93,0:01:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在地下活动 我是破坏之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am always beneath you, but nothing is beneath me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.77,0:01:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可事情更奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if things aren't weird enough, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.60,0:01:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还从车底下看到了几个怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look over and I see these boots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.14,0:01:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:02:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 真的要上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Should we be doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,用超能力还是违法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is still illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.75,0:02:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好像是超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They looked like superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.01,0:02:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再不上就跟丢了 - 那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gonna lose him. - Oh, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人控制现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of you patrol the perimeter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证周围市民的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep the crowds back and safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个 照顾好小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other, watch after Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们也要去战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought we were gonna go with…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.72,0:02:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮我个忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快送我上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trampoline me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.36,0:02:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去控制现场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call perimeter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪也不许去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这小捣蛋鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}you little maggoty creep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看准时机想赶快逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see my chance to get out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.13,0:02:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 有一个女孩的声音听着有些耳熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's something familiar about one of the kids' voices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl, she's upset{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一生气就把面具给摘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she throws down her mask…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Tony!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我好像不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, this isn't what you think it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just getting too freaky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一下接受不了 就跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't handle it and ran off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得有点对不起她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel kinda bad about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我应该跟她打声招呼什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should've said "hi" or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人不合法也不是她的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not her fault superheroes are illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.93,0:02:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是不喜欢厉害的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not like I don't like strong girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.94,0:02:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我对我自己很有 信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty secure manhood-wise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.51,0:02:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和别人说起这件事吗 比如你父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you told anyone else about this? Your parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他们肯定以为我在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they'd only think I was hiding something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:02:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您能明白吗 - 很明白 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what I mean? - Sure, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢这个女孩 迪瑞克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like this girl, Mr. Dicker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来周五晚上要和她出去约会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to go out with her Friday night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜那只能成为遗憾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, things are just gonna be weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望能忘掉那天看见的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could forget I ever saw her in that suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会忘掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.83,0:03:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.56,0:03:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗之外的一切都破坏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider yourself undermined!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.79,0:04:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 暗中破坏王 - 我们又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Underminer! - We meet again… Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.90,0:04:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去 现在还得费事处理掉他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great! Now, he's on the agenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,超能先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你尝尝我的厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet Jack Hammer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.23,0:04:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buh-bye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.79,0:05:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人往后退 往后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, stay back! Okay? Stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,又想让我带孩子 自己逞英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not sticking me with babysitting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻头失控了 停不下来 暗中破坏王那家伙跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't steer it or stop it. And the Underminer's escaped!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须让它停下 鲍勃 列车来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to stop it… Bob! The monorail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是酷冰侠 耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frozone! Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,得让列车停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stop this thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.63,0:05:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让他破坏钢架桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it gets to the overpass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.86,0:05:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量让它远离建筑物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try to keep it away from the buildings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.27,0:06:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, lady!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太谢谢你了 年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much, young man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.82,0:06:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴小倩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.34,0:06:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.81,0:07:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸小心 - 小飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heads up, Dad! - Dash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小倩 你怎么不看着小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violet! Who's watching Jack-Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,小飞在照看他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dash is watching him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.15,0:07:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小倩 你抱着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violet, here, you take him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.66,0:07:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它冲着市中心去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's headed for City Hall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去帮妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom needs help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人又现身了 这是我们的好机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're out in public again! This is our chance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上他们 跟上酷冰侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow them, follow Frozone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃 帮我搞定那个锅炉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob! Help me with the boiler!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就没问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这干什么 还不赶快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you kids doing? Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.98,0:08:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就要爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing's gonna blow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动 超人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze, Supers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我们又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what did we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 您是 酷冰侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Mr. Zone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我出现在这违法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, but I'm not really supposed to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太不公平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which seems wrong…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.39,0:08:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你有这个兴趣 改变法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you'd be interested in changing that law?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,几位超人 包括酷冰侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superheroes including Frozone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,超能先生 和弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Incredible, and Elastigirl…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.23,0:08:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对城市建筑造成很大破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}caused further damage to the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,暗中破坏王仍然逍遥法外\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Underminer remains at large.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,先动手的又不是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't start this fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也没有阻止他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you didn't finish it either!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们阻止暗中破坏王破坏城市了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you stop the Underminer from inflicting more damage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.31,0:09:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们成功阻止他们抢银行了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you stop him from robbing the banks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.87,0:09:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 你们抓住他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Did you catch him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 银行都有保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - The banks were insured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那突发情况我们也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have infrastructure in place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.11,0:09:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,相应的基础措施进行应对\N{\fnArial\fs30}to deal with these matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.35,0:09:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是这次你们没有乱插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had simply done nothing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.15,0:09:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会顺畅无阻的解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything would now be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.82,0:09:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}proceeding in an orderly fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你想让我们什么都不做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd have preferred we do nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without a doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不帮我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't much help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不想别人坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want out of the hole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就别自己先往坑里跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}First you gotta put down the shovel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算哪门子事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that went poorly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我知道你今天不开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, this is probably{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该给你添堵\N{\fnArial\fs30}not the best time to tell you about this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 今天还有一件别的事 有个同学\N{\fnArial\fs30}but something else happened today with a kid…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了我摘了面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.53,0:10:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对了 迪瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, Rick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.04,0:10:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小倩的一个朋友 一个叫托尼的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violet thinks a friend of hers, a kid named Tony…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能看到她是超人了 当时她没带面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}might have seen her in the outfit, without her mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是大嘴巴么 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Talkative type? - Don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道他姓莱丁格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last name is Rydinger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼·莱丁格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony Rydinger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃 何莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob, Helen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有句话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}a word if you don't mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.15,0:10:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人援助项目遭到中止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the program's been shut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.59,0:10:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些政客永远不能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Politicians don't understand people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人做好事只是因为他们想伸张正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}who do good simply because it's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞得那些政客很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes 'em nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来他们一直想抓超人的把柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been gunning for Supers for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.17,0:10:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天让他们抓了个正着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today was all they needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,总而言之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.47,0:10:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能在帮你们再多交\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid two more weeks in the motel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个星期的汽车旅馆住宿费\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the best I can do for ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.45,0:10:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮不上太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我们做的够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done plenty, Rick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会忘记的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸能和你们这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it has been a great honor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,善良的人一起工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}working with you good people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你做的一切 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for everything, and good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:11:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.41,0:11:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才洗手了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you wash your hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.41,0:11:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该用肥皂洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}With soap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你擦手了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you dry them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.35,0:11:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 里面怎么都是难吃的蔬菜 哪个讨厌鬼点这么多菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Is this all vegetables? Who ordered all vegetables?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我点的 多吃蔬菜有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did. They're good and you're going to have some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们难道就不提这事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we going to talk about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事 - 大家都装看不见的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - The elephant in the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.33,0:11:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么看不见的事 - 那我还是不要提了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What elephant? - I guess not then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.97,0:11:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指的是今天的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're referring to today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.17,0:11:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 今天到底是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what's the deal with today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会犯错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all made mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,举个例子来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.34,0:11:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个今天应该照顾小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}you kids were supposed to watch Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们去看孩子 你们俩打击犯罪拯救城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babysitting, while you guys did the important stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talked about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们年纪太小还不能做决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not old enough to decide about these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:11:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们多少能帮上点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are old enough to help out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.02,0:12:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.12,0:12:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你说的吗 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that what you tell us, Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.72,0:12:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这个 帮忙也可以有很多种形式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, "help out" can mean many different things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有麻烦我们就应该帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're supposed to help, if there's trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.96,0:12:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 也对 - 你们难道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, yeah, but… - Aren't you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不为我们今天帮忙而高兴吗 - 我很高兴 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- glad we helped today? - Yeah, I know but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过为我们感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that you were proud of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说了是骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, I was. Am!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也要去教训坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanna fight bad guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你们不许去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过情况已经不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said things were different now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确不一样 那可是在岛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they were, on the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没有说你们现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't mean that from now on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.65,0:12:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们以后永远不能使用超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now, we've gotta go back to never using our powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会影响我的人生观\N{\fnArial\fs30}It defines who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没说你们不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not saying you have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 电视里就是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Someone on TV said it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能先吃饭 先别吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,饭都快凉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dinner, while it's hot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天做错事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we do something wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.59,0:12:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.10,0:12:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天做的不是错事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't do anything wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用超能力还是违法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superheroes are illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管公不公平 这就是法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether it's fair or not, that's the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,法律就应该公平 不然我们怎么教育孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The law should be fair. What are we teaching our kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.71,0:12:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们怎么尊重法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}To respect the law!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是那法律是不公平的 不值得尊重的 怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when the law is disrespectful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,法律不公平也通过法律来修正\N{\fnArial\fs30}If laws are unjust, there are laws to change them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然一切都乱套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, it's chaos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.45,0:12:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们生活就已经乱套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is exactly what we have!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是觉得 只有那样才酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought it was kinda cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.56,0:13:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪样才酷 - 与家人一起 去打击犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was? - Fighting crime as a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也过去了 世界就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's over. The world is what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必需要适应世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to adapt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界是不是很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are things bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I be excused?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.81,0:13:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要在汽车旅馆住到什么时候呀爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer in the motel, Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.82,0:13:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃… - 不会太久了宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh… - Not much longer, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.06,0:13:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许迪瑞克还会帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Dicker will find something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.57,0:13:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会再帮我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dicker is done, Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想要再一次成为超人 根本就是幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any thought we had about being Supers again is fantasy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中至少得有一个人找份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of us has gotta get a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,找份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在安心保险干了很多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did a long stint at Insuricare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一分钟都会是煎熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hated every minute of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.14,0:13:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这样你很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it was hard on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:14:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我去找份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's my turn in the private sector{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在家里照顾孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you take care of the kids…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 还是我去吧 我必须要工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm doing this. I need to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的西服和领带你放哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where my suit and ties are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机砸中了我们房子的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burned up when…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,都烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jet destroyed our house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在不能依靠任何人的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't count on anyone else now, Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能等着别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't wait for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人护着咱们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No lifeguard on duty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,得自力更生咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swim at your own risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.35,0:14:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天又跑哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, where'd you go today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不跟我们去喝茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed you missed all the fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别生气 因为我知道什么是优雅退场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be mad because I know when to leave a party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我和你们一样违反了法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just as illegal as you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.39,0:14:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 我还知道警察会放了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I knew the cops would let you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.19,0:14:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 鲍勃还想多住两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, in spite of Bob's best efforts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.43,0:14:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说援助项目停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard the program shut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在旅馆里还能住多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer are you in this motel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.47,0:14:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 你说了我可以帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you know the offer still stands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的好意 可我们家有五口人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very generous, but there are five of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.51,0:14:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能跑去给你们添麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wouldn't do that to you and Honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.31,0:14:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 随时欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, door's always open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:15:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过今天不光只有坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the news isn't all bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在警察局里喝茶的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you guys were being detained…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.81,0:15:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人来找我 他可是大财团的代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was approached by a dude who represents this tycoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.65,0:15:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 文斯顿·迪沃 - 他想找我谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Winston Deavor. - Wants to talk…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你们两个 谈谈超能力的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}with me, with you two, about hero stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.69,0:15:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很守法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's legit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是迪瑞克的学生 他想见我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trained under Dicker. He wants to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天哪 又是超能力惹来的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, jeez! More superhero trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天刚从警察局里出来鲁修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just came from the police station, Lucius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候去 - 今天晚上 我现在就过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When? - Tonight. I'm going there now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你一路顺风 我们就不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You enjoy, I'm sitting this one out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想叫我们三个一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants all three of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我们起码先去听听他要说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, let's just at least hear what he has to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,地址在名片上 我们一会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the address, I'll meet you guys there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.38,0:15:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还得穿超能装去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go in our Supersuits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还是穿旧式超能装比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might wanna wear the old Supersuits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.55,0:15:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉那个人挺怀旧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a feeling he's nostalgic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上外面的空气特别的新鲜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fresh air is especially good tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是小杰醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Jack-Jack wakes up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the drill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.35,0:16:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们的识别牌 请走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your security badges. Please, this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对了 我是您的头号粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, you're my biggest fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我是您的头号粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your biggest fan. Shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 最爱超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love superheroes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大的超能力 超能装\N{\fnArial\fs30}The powers, the costumes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有华丽的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mythic struggles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是文斯顿·迪沃 可以叫我阿文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winston Deavor. You can call me Win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常高兴能见到各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genuine pleasure to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 酷冰侠 - 我也很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Frozone! - It's good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.43,0:16:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弹力女超人 - 见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Elastigirl. - Nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有超能先生 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Incredible! - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直无法用言语表达我内心的兴奋 这位是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't tell you what a thrill this is. And this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好各位超人们 真的非常抱歉我迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello there, superheroes. I'm so sorry I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我拖拖拉拉的妹妹 伊芙琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is my tardy sister, Evelyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确拖拉 我先自责 你不用这么指责我好吗 文斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm scolding myself so you don't have to, Winston!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spectacular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.33,0:17:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲一定非常自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was so proud{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能和各位超人有一星半点的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I was even remotely connected to you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.54,0:17:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他管你们叫 正义的最后一道防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to call you the last line of defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最支持超能力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was your top supporter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.71,0:17:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出钱支持超人事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}He donated to superhero causes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还筹资\N{\fnArial\fs30}He raised money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,修建了市中心公园的傲魄侠雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Dynaguy statue in Avery Park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认识不少超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got to know many Supers personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.52,0:17:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至家里还安装了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even installed a phone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}with direct lines to Gazerbeam and Fironic…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,能直接打给电光眼和长枪侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case of emergencies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可高兴了 天天对人炫耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loved that, showed it off to everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们被迫停止活动的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was heartbroken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的很伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you were all forced to go underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:17:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲相信世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father believed the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果少了超人的保护会更危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}would become more dangerous without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到他的话成真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't know how right he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.37,0:18:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里进了贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a break-in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲马上打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father called Gazerbeam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.01,0:18:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接向电光眼求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}The direct line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.65,0:18:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人接\N{\fnArial\fs30}No answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又打给长枪侠 也没有人接\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called Fironic, no answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时刚刚宣布禁止使用超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superheroes had just been made illegal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲就在电话旁边被强盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The robbers discovered him on the phone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪杀害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.73,0:18:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must've been hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲尤其难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially for Mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月后母亲伤心过度 也过世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died a few months later. Heartbreak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果超人没有被迫隐藏身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}If superheroes had not been forced underground…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.74,0:18:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许父亲也不会被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}it never would've happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者父亲可以一听到强盗进屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Dad could've taken Mom to the safe room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就带着妈妈躲进安全屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}as soon as he knew there was trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不能同意这种说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I disagree strongly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在还是不要讨论这个问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're not going into it right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是当时没人相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会顺利接手\N{\fnArial\fs30}nobody expected us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续经营父亲的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be able to actually run Dad's company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 伊芙琳是设计师 我又擅长经商\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with Evelyn as designer, and myself as operator…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们夜以继日的工作 迪沃科技才不断发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, we threw ourselves into building DEVTECH{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:18:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了今天的成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}into what it is today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是世界上数一数二的大型电信公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world-class telecommunications company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,规模非常大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bigger than ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,大企业就更要负起责任 支持正义的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfectly positioned to make some wrong things right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.07,0:19:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hence, this meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先问一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说你们被迫停止活动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the main reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.41,0:19:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正原因是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were all forced underground?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为人们的无知 - 其实是印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ignorance. - Perception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就拿暗中破坏王的事来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take today for example, with the Underminer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况非常危急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Difficult situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要迅速做出许多艰难的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were faced with a lot of hard decisions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.42,0:19:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, tell me about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不知道这个过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我并没有亲眼看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I didn't see it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人也看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}neither did anyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你们今天奋力和坏人搏斗的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when you fight bad guys like today…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们既看不到战斗也不知道前因后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}people don't see the fight or what led up to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只能看到政客想让他们看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see what politicians tell them to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看到了破坏 又看到了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see destruction and they see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.64,0:19:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 如果我们想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if we wanna change{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻底改变公众的对超级英雄过时的印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}people's perceptions about superheroes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们与世界分享你们独有的超级视角\N{\fnArial\fs30}to share your perceptions with the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.18,0:19:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 具体应该怎么做呢 - 用镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do we do that? - With cameras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把超人的视角分享给全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you to share your perceptions with the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在你们穿的超能装里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We embed tiny cameras, like those, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,安装微型摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}into your Supersuits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:19:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 真小巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, so small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.69,0:20:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是画质非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the picture is outstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 是我亲自设计的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks! Designed 'em myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有资源 有活动家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got resources, lobbyists, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在全世界都有非常广泛的人脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}worldwide connections…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.90,0:20:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有最重要的 就是保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}and very important, insurance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险才是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insurance is key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.77,0:20:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在缺的就是最厉害的超人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we need now are the super-est superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.18,0:20:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是你们三位 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It needs you three. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入我们 努力让超能力再次合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me make all Supers legal again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.01,0:20:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sounds great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就开始吧 我的任务是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this going. What's my first assignment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,超能先生 你这种热情非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That enthusiasm is golden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保持住 其实我们要想改变超人形象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now hold on to it. But for our first move…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.92,0:20:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点在弹力女超人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Elastigirl is our best play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.69,0:20:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道 她比我更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 她很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.73,0:20:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真的很有能力 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, a credit to her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂得 你懂我意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know. You know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很尊重您\N{\fnArial\fs30}With great respect…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过您还是不要太依赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's not test the whole{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.01,0:20:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险反正都可以理赔 这种想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}"insurance-will-pay- for-everything" idea…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.91,0:20:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是一开始的时候好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the first go 'round, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.11,0:20:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你是什么意思 我能力不太行么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. You're saying what? I'm messy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样 伊芙琳作了成本收益分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Evelyn did a cost-benefit analysis…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,比较了你们停止活动之前五年间\N{\fnArial\fs30}comparing all your last five years of crime fighting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.22,0:20:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打击犯罪情况的数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}before going underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力女超人的数据是最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Elastigirl's numbers are self-explanatory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.92,0:20:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种比较根本就不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not a fair comparison!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 重要的问题就得用重量级的解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavyweight problems need heavyweight solutions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的对 最终所有的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course! We're gonna solve{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.56,0:21:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}all kinds of problems together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.63,0:21:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 在此之前要来一次完美的公关 重点推出弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the perfect launch with Elastigirl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问我怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.58,0:21:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.78,0:21:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么可能不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, you don't know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个小时前 你还说超能力的时代已经过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few hours ago, you were saying it was over…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.88,0:21:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,当超人只是幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}and being a superhero was a fantasy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.09,0:21:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在改变人生的好机会来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you get the offer of a lifetime{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.19,0:21:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然说你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.86,0:21:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么简单 鲍勃 我还要考虑保护孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that simple, Bob. I wanna protect the kids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也在考虑孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.59,0:21:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,违法是会坐牢的 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}From jail, Bob!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么才能不违法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在明明有改变法律的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}By turning down a chance to change the law{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.87,0:21:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让孩子们以后不用再隐藏能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}that forces them to hide what they are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们自己还不知道自己要什么 他们还只是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They haven't decided what they are. They're still kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是有超能力的孩子 也就是超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids with powers, which makes them Supers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管以后他们决定用不用超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether they decide to use those powers or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.88,0:21:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样都对他们有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will benefit them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在最应该陪着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a good time to be away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.05,0:21:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小飞连作业都做不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dash is having trouble with homework…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,小倩成天想着约会的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vi is worried about her first date{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是和那个她喜欢的男孩子 叫托尼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that boy she likes, Tony…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:21:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后小杰又\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Jack-Jack…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.95,0:22:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰 小杰怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack-Jack? What's wrong with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 小杰没有任何问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, nothing's wrong with Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.22,0:22:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过就是普通孩子也需要很多关心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even a normal baby needs a lot of attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.99,0:22:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总感觉不该离开家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just not sure I can leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不能离开家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you can leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.26,0:22:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要去 只要我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to. So that I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以重新正大光明的当超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can be Supers again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.30,0:22:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的孩子才能选择未来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}so our kids can have that choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你的未来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can have that choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.17,0:22:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的对 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.37,0:22:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的是我的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can have that choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且让我上 我一定能做的非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would do a great job!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.28,0:22:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管文斯顿那个倒霉数据说的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regardless of what Deavor's pie charts say or whatever…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.05,0:22:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 他们要的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they want you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也 一定会像我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll do a great…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.66,0:22:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}job…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.36,0:22:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,出色\N{\fnArial\fs30}too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.16,0:22:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你这样连我都跟着着难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was excruciating to watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能对你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lie to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.23,0:22:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被选上了很开心 更要飘飘然了 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to be wanted. Flattering, you know, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么选\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what's the choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.77,0:22:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 好好工作拿到报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, do this right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.07,0:22:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能搬出汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}get well paid, we're out of the motel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.67,0:22:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,超能力合法化对超人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and things get better for all Supers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.28,0:22:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对孩子们也有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}including our kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.68,0:22:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在两周内找到工作 要不然我们就只能流落街头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find a job in two weeks or we're homeless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.68,0:22:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这有多疯狂么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it's crazy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.15,0:23:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了家人 我得离开家\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help my family, I gotta leave it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.69,0:23:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要改变法律 得先违法\N{\fnArial\fs30}To fix the law, I gotta break it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会做的很棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.89,0:23:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.06,0:23:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你怎么办 还有孩子要照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about you? We have kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.13,0:23:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会看孩子 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll watch the kids, no problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.93,0:23:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很简单 - 很简单啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Easy. - Easy, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're adorable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.16,0:23:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正如果真的有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if there is a problem, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就随时赶过来好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drop this thing and come right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.83,0:23:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't need to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.07,0:23:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来搞定 你尽管去工作是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it, you go do this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,认真工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.97,0:23:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我做得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.68,0:23:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是文斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deavor here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.85,0:23:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.78,0:23:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯顿先生 真的谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Deavor, it's wonderful…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.42,0:23:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这也太破费了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's too generous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里哪里 这点小事不足挂齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nonsense! That's the least we can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.46,0:23:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在是合作伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're partners now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.99,0:23:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么能让你们住在汽车旅馆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't have my partners living in a motel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.96,0:23:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这是谁的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whose house? Is it a house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.33,0:23:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的房子 我有好几套\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my house. I have several.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.23,0:23:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那套平时也没人住 你们尽管住就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not using that one. Stay as long as you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.80,0:23:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道说什么好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.37,0:23:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你说 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about "thanks"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的新家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our new house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.31,0:23:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别太激动 是借给我们住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, easy, tiger. It's being loaned to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.81,0:23:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还真舒适 豪华\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is homey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看这地方 真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.22,0:24:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯顿买下这里之前 别墅的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deavor bought it from an eccentric billionaire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.92,0:24:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个不喜欢暴露行踪的亿万富翁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who liked to come and go without being seen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.42,0:24:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以房子里有好几个秘密出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}so the house has multiple hidden exits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.09,0:24:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一个不显眼的别墅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing we won't stand out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.76,0:24:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在这 我们肯定不会再乱七八糟的人给盯上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't want to attract any unnecessary attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.90,0:24:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个院子真大啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got a big yard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.93,0:24:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不是有点太夸张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't this a bit much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.17,0:24:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,旁边还有森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Near a forest!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.97,0:24:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你更愿意住汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you rather be at the motel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.84,0:24:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有泳池\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a pool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.14,0:24:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈的新工作到底是做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly is Mom's new job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.31,0:24:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的事我们不用在住旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The important thing is we're out of the motel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.94,0:24:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢妈妈的新工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like Mom's new job!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.29,0:24:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看别墅里还有瀑布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, check out the water features.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.93,0:24:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦！- 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh! - Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.33,0:24:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wicked cool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.94,0:24:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,小飞别玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Dash! Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.41,0:25:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别把沙发毁了 住手 - 住手 小飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not the couch! Stop it! - No! Dash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.21,0:25:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.81,0:25:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别乱按按钮 - 沙发进水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't touch the buttons! - The couch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.98,0:25:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小飞 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dash! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.15,0:25:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.09,0:25:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.99,0:25:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 是我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.26,0:25:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这衣服是暗黑风格的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not all dark and angsty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.83,0:25:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.96,0:25:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是很灵活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, you know, flexible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.97,0:25:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伊芙琳设计的\N{\fnArial\fs30}E designed this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.20,0:25:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是个叫亚历山大·盖尔巴奇的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, some guy named Alexander Galbaki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.17,0:25:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好是你穿不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad it's you and not me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.31,0:25:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为莫衣娜肯定会来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're gonna hear from her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.04,0:25:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张纸条也是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This note came with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.44,0:25:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.39,0:25:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然是新的弹力摩托车\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new Elasticycle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.39,0:25:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力摩托车 我真不知道你还会骑摩托车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elasticycle? I didn't know you had a bike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.32,0:25:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有段时间莫西干发型呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I had a mohawk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.22,0:25:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的是你不知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot about me you don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.06,0:25:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫西干发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but… A mohawk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.10,0:25:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 也没什么大不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you didn't miss anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.87,0:25:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆车是电动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah! This one's electric.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.24,0:25:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思 - 哇哇哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that mean? - Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.08,0:26:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是扭矩大了点 我能驾驭的住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means it's torque-y. I'll get the hang of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.05,0:26:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会很棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.31,0:26:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然会很棒 你也会很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be great. And you will, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.15,0:26:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩都很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will both be great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.95,0:26:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.01,0:26:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.38,0:26:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是弹力女超人吗 - 我觉得那是弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that Elastigirl? - I think that's Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.91,0:26:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Elastigirl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.09,0:26:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你 弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marry me, Elastigirl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.06,0:26:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别唱歌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No theme songs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.33,0:26:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然我就掉头回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'll turn this bus right around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.90,0:26:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看窗外的景色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.47,0:26:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是新城\N{\fnArial\fs30}New Urbem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.47,0:27:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要记录下打击犯罪的大新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna make a big crime fighting statement…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.61,0:27:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要去犯罪率最高的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go where the crime is big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.34,0:27:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你因为犯罪率高感到兴奋这也太奇怪了 文斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange thing to be excited about, Winston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.95,0:27:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里简直是让超人施展拳脚的最佳场所\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a superhero's playground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.02,0:27:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在家就不许吃糖球\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Sugar Bombs on my watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.49,0:27:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.59,0:27:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她出门上班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's up and out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.93,0:27:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是弹力女超人上班的第一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's at her new job doing hero work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.36,0:27:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 现在法律还是规定不许使用超能力吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought superheroes were still illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.17,0:27:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 是暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are, for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.60,0:27:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以妈妈是拿着工资 在做违法的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Mom is getting paid to break the law?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.97,0:27:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是做违法的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not breaking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.21,0:27:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在努力工作 努力让超能力合法化\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's an advocate for superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.57,0:27:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个新工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a new job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.71,0:27:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说妈妈违反法律使用超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mom is going out illegally…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.51,0:27:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终的目的是为了超能力的合法化\N{\fnArial\fs30}to explain why she shouldn't be illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.68,0:27:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的校车来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bus is here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.39,0:27:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去拿东西 快 快点去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Grab your stuff quickly! Go on, get on the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.06,0:27:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得把作业本带上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your homework in your pack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.29,0:27:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.27,0:28:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们两个也能相处的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get along just fine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.67,0:28:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不会问我什么麻烦的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you don't ask any hard questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.01,0:28:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了 各部门注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All locations, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.38,0:28:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有情况请通知我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to know where you want us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.65,0:28:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,请待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.01,0:28:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可真奇怪 我居然要在这等着有人犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems strange to wait for crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.72,0:28:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 你现在身处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. You're smack in the middle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.55,0:28:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市里犯罪率最高的地区 非常完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the worst crime area in the city. It's perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.19,0:28:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是超人的运动场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a superhero's playground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.59,0:28:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人的运动场 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It's a superhero's playground." Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.29,0:28:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我们停止活动的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, after we went underground…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.99,0:28:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老公天天听着警方的通报\N{\fnArial\fs30}my husband used to listen to a police scanner…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.03,0:28:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着出点什么乱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for something to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.63,0:28:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这个我还发火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got mad at him for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.27,0:28:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到头来我跟他一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm such a hypocrite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.70,0:28:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各单位注意 - 有情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All units. - Something's up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.37,0:28:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说有人可能扰乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been picking up some chatter about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.91,0:28:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,悬浮列车的发车仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}potential disruptions to the hovertrain's opening ceremony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.11,0:28:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是捣乱还是威胁 - 都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Disruption or threat? - Both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.41,0:28:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,发车仪式在54大街和都金汉路交叉口进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Station's at Fifty-Fourth and Nottingham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.05,0:28:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有危险 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A potential threat! Perfect!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.15,0:28:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上去那里 快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty-fourth and Nottingham. Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.19,0:28:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 小倩晚上十点半之前必须回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Vi! I want you back here by 10:30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.59,0:28:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,十一点之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}11-ish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.66,0:28:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,十点之前要不就九点半之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}10-ish, heading for 9:30-ish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.06,0:28:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就十点半之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}10:30-ish it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.13,0:28:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看电影吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the movie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.67,0:29:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在远方的睡眠国\N{\fnArial\fs30}"In the county of Noddoff…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.77,0:29:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的男孩和女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the Frubbers of Freep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.70,0:29:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要进入甜蜜的梦乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}"are all giving in to the sweet succor of sleep."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.59,0:29:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们控制水平线\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will control the horizontal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.09,0:29:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们控制垂直线\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will control the vertical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.06,0:29:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么做和书上的做法不一样吧 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the way you're supposed to do it, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.37,0:29:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的标准减法是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us to do it this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.24,0:29:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会那样做 难不成数学题还会变么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know that way! Why would they change math?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.24,0:29:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 爸爸 - 怎么做不是做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay, Dad. - Math is math!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.47,0:29:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等妈妈回来我在做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just wait for Mom to get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.58,0:29:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.58,0:29:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种难题我都不会做 你妈妈也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't understand it any better than I do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.45,0:29:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星界限\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Outer Limits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.09,0:29:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在远方的睡眠国\N{\fnArial\fs30}"All over Doozle-Dorf, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.49,0:29:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的男孩和女孩都要睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the Fribbers of Frupp are going to sleep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.12,0:29:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为孩子们的哈欠连天\N{\fnArial\fs30}"'cause they just can't keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.29,0:30:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在疲倦的睡眠国 大人也要睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"All over Doozle-Dorf, Doozles are dozing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.13,0:30:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的眼皮渐渐闭上了 头垂下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Eyelids so heavy, they're drooping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.70,0:30:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 重点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Closing! The point is:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.54,0:30:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了晚上每个人 每个人都躺在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Everyone, everyone's hitting the sack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.27,0:30:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都睡得特别香\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Everyone's getting the sleep that they lack."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.51,0:30:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长们都喜欢吹嘘自己城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayors often brag about their cities…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.71,0:30:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm no exception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.52,0:30:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm willing to admit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.78,0:30:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,新城是唯一一座…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that New Urbem is not the only city…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.15,0:30:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定警察不会来找麻烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure the police are gonna be okay with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.42,0:30:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定 你这是在帮他们的忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. You're making life easy for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.42,0:30:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我们给警察帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still haven't forgiven us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.83,0:30:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,到现在他们还记仇呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the last time we made life easy for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.66,0:30:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识这边的警察局长 不会有问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the Chief of Police. There won't be a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.70,0:30:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.60,0:30:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是上次暗中破坏王的事 你自己去搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you alone had handled the Underminer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.23,0:30:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果会不一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}things would have been different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.24,0:30:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有别的意思哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.60,0:30:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且工程按照预算 提前完工\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on budget and ahead of schedule…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.71,0:30:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎大家观摩悬浮列车\N{\fnArial\fs30}to launch our magnificent new hovertrain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.34,0:30:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,乘坐它去往你向往的目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can get you where you need to go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.85,0:30:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且速度特别快\N{\fnArial\fs30}at ridiculous speeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.82,0:30:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让列车向着美好的未来前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future is open for business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.41,0:31:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 车停下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. The train has stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.41,0:31:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,开的方向不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going the wrong direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.21,0:31:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,车走的方向不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going the wrong way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.75,0:31:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去追\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going after it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.62,0:31:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车的速度是160公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing's really moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.26,0:31:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还在加速 现在轨道有多长\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 and climbing. How much track is built?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.86,0:31:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多40公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 25 miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.60,0:31:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道没人能让列车停下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can shut this thing down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.91,0:31:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,试过了 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've tried. No-go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.28,0:31:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是弹力女超人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Elastigirl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:31:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,能远程控制么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overrides?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.49,0:31:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们封锁了系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're locked out of the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.56,0:32:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能启动保险装置吗 - 时间不够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about a fail-safe? - Not enough time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.84,0:32:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人打电话 我先接一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's calling! Switching over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.81,0:32:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 妈妈我找不到运动鞋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mom. I can't find my high-tops{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.71,0:32:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸也找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Dad can't find them either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.38,0:32:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不愿意打电话问你 所以只能我来问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he won't call you and ask, so I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.58,0:32:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别给你妈打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not call your mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.25,0:32:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小飞 好孩子 我现在不能说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dash, honey. Can't talk right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.65,0:32:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,找找你床底下 还有多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look under your bed, okay. How much time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.55,0:32:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到两分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less than two minutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.52,0:32:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一条近路 从前面的排气管传过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a shortcut. Cut through the culvert up ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.66,0:32:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道能不能追上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I can stay with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.43,0:34:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the heck was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.10,0:34:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家还好吗 有人受伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everybody all right? Is anybody injured?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.40,0:34:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.94,0:34:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看你在搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your story better be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.55,0:35:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.52,0:35:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, why are you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.75,0:35:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别问了 什么也别问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.66,0:35:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小倩 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dad. Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.03,0:35:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 我只是现在什么话也不想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. I don't wanna talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.23,0:35:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼没有联系你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony didn't even call?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.90,0:35:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了我现在不想说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.94,0:35:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 你 - 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, honey… - Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.67,0:35:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是真为我好你就让我自己待会行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want me to feel better, then leave me alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.54,0:36:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.64,0:36:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说 警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, there's nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.85,0:36:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,最讨厌的 就是那种失踪儿童案\N{\fnArial\fs30}a cop hates worse than a missing child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.18,0:36:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟的人儿子 今天是他一周岁生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kid brother's son. Today is his first birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.78,0:36:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要说有谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but if anybody{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.15,0:36:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,能找到那个孩子 就是你了 罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}can find that child, it's you, Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.49,0:36:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是一位出色的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're a wonderful policeman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.02,0:36:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来抢劫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a holdup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.83,0:36:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来 转过身去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get your hands up, turn your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.93,0:36:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把两只手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands behind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.20,0:36:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱着头 不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}your heads and keep them there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.70,0:36:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.10,0:36:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下 到那边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop that. All right, now get over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.20,0:36:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看紧大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.67,0:36:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我们开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm kiddin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.58,0:36:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.08,0:36:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.82,0:36:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞定了 我跟你说 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it! Come on, I tell you, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.22,0:36:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想死么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.92,0:38:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.93,0:38:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.40,0:38:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.00,0:38:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.84,0:38:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.85,0:38:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也有 超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have powers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.29,0:38:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.89,0:38:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上一点伤都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's not a scratch on you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.96,0:38:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是直接穿过了门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you go through the locked door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.69,0:38:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有穿墙的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are those your powers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.96,0:38:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁这么厉害能变出好多分身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who can multiply like rabbits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.06,0:38:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能任意穿过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go right through any solid…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.00,0:39:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.81,0:39:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 嗨亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Hey, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.25,0:39:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没给我打电话 - 哦 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You weren't gonna call me? - Oh, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.12,0:39:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没打 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I mean, yes, yeah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.25,0:39:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想打来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just didn't wanna wake you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.69,0:39:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才在院子里发生了很奇特的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The strangest thing just happened out in the yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.76,0:39:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是把你吵醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like I just woke you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.89,0:39:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.39,0:39:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是 小杰他 - 他出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's just, Jack-Jack… - He had an accident!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.09,0:39:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.16,0:39:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就回家 我就不该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming home right now! I never should have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.10,0:39:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰没出事 你就安心工作 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No accident. Stay there and finish your mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.43,0:39:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never should…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.97,0:39:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你觉得我搞不定家务事么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You don't think I can do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.04,0:39:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 对不起 我说错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Sorry. I misspoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.74,0:39:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我回家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you need me to come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.14,0:39:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 不用 我能搞定 我这很顺利 一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No, I've got this. Everything's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.01,0:39:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才说小杰怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened with Jack-Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.91,0:39:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 他非常非常健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. He's in excellent health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.15,0:39:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.25,0:39:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小倩的约会怎么样 - 呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How was Violet's date? - Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.92,0:39:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,约会是在今天晚上 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was tonight, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.72,0:39:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.29,0:39:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有问题 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All fine and good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.30,0:39:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰有没有闹 乖乖睡着了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jack-Jack went down with no trouble?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.26,0:40:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, yes, no trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.03,0:40:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小飞的作业 写完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Dash got his homework done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.90,0:40:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,都写完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.17,0:40:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 不是我刚一离开家\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, things haven't spiraled out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.44,0:40:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就乱成一锅粥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of control the moment I left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.44,0:40:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然听起来很不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing as it may seem, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.31,0:40:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我和孩子们并没有出任何问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}it has been quite uneventful in fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.98,0:40:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.41,0:40:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了一辆列车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved a runaway train!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.88,0:40:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太刺激了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.42,0:40:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长也在场 参加新列车的剪彩仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mayor was there to cut the ribbon on this new train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.19,0:40:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力女超人紧随身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elastigirl pursued the train{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.99,0:40:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,追上列车 并成功救下了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was able to successfully activate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.16,0:40:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长说了几句话 剪了彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah, blah, blah. He says a few words, cuts the ribbon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.46,0:40:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果列车一出站\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the train starts pulling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.79,0:40:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就朝着反方向冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of the station backwards…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.33,0:40:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,全新的气垫列车轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…track of its brand new hovertrain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.03,0:40:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}…malfunctioned…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.80,0:40:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…thanking Elastigirl…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.20,0:40:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superhero Elastigirl…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.47,0:40:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elastigirl…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.81,0:40:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 没人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom! No casualties!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.08,0:40:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶特制的摩托车\N{\fnArial\fs30}…specialized motorbike, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.34,0:40:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救了所有乘客\N{\fnArial\fs30}saving all of the passengers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.95,0:40:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件接着一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing leads to another{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.05,0:40:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我追了上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and suddenly, I go after it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.22,0:40:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说 真是太险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, honey, it was a saga!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.52,0:40:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太棒了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fantastic, honey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.49,0:40:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出任务的第一天晚上就这么成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on your first night!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.89,0:40:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so proud of you, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.93,0:40:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你也感到骄傲 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proud of you, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.46,0:41:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你也想出来工作 很快就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you want to get out there and you will soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.13,0:41:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会非常出色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll be amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.10,0:41:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't have done this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.33,0:41:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为你把家事都安排好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you hadn't taken over so well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.97,0:41:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你为我做了这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for handling everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.80,0:41:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.20,0:41:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 亲爱的 我很快就回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, honey. I'll be back soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.31,0:41:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做个好梦 - 你也是 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sweet dreams. - Sweet dreams, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.43,0:41:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, Dad, it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.33,0:41:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是等妈妈回来好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'll just wait for Mom to get home."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.13,0:41:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的就像她能…我知道怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if she could… I know how to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.87,0:41:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能搞定数学题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do math.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.12,0:41:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, brother…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.12,0:41:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等妈妈回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.23,0:42:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这算什么 临时父母么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I, a substitute parent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.26,0:42:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们改了解法又不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my fault they changed math.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.94,0:42:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 小飞 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, buddy. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.28,0:42:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像琢磨出来你的数学作业怎么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I understand your math assignment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.08,0:42:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,考试之前还有点时间 我们还来得及复习\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have some time to finish it before your test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.92,0:42:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着做 把所有的数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}So first, you wanna put all the numbers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.89,0:42:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,都放到等号后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}by themselves on one side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.66,0:42:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要改变正负号\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you change the sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.49,0:42:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说正变成负 负变成正\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means a plus becomes a minus and a minus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.53,0:42:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.03,0:42:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 你真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.45,0:42:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Uh, hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.01,0:42:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们搬新家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a new house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.35,0:42:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我特意在你的柜子门上写了新地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did write my address on your locker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.62,0:42:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,用的还是不褪色的墨水\N{\fnArial\fs30}in permanent ink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.66,0:43:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来这个是你写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, is that what that is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.96,0:43:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是忘了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you forget?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.46,0:43:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.26,0:43:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真逗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.53,0:43:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你加一分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Points for funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.24,0:43:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为那个奇怪装束的事么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, was it the weird outfit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.37,0:43:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there's a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.97,0:43:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们学校有戏曲表演课\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a drama class…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.11,0:43:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 作业是要演莎士比亚的剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they just wanna do Shakespeare…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.31,0:43:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就是这种东西让小孩们喜欢看\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're like, "Try to make it relevant for the kids."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.28,0:43:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说演超人 小孩最喜欢超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, like, "Oh, superheroes! Kids love superheroes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.99,0:43:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来想穿另外一种紧身服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna wear one kind of tights…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.95,0:43:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then they're like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.22,0:43:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你得穿别种的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"No, wear these other kind of tights."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.52,0:43:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.40,0:43:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人对于今天的演讲非常关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many say your speech today is critical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.57,0:43:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,两派人都是为人民福祉而努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both sides just want the best for their people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.34,0:43:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上就能让这地区迎来和平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so close to finally getting peace in the region.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.21,0:43:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都好久没上过电视了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't done this in a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.11,0:43:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 救列车就是个好开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is good. The train gives us momentum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.41,0:43:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就放心去 展现你平时的魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go out there and be your charming self…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.65,0:43:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,使其充分发挥作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}and capitalize on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.12,0:44:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力女超人 那边已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Elastigirl, they're ready for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.59,0:44:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,上台前 伸伸腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stretch a leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.29,0:44:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 查德 聊得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Chad. It was fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.03,0:44:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大使女士 这是你的文件 我们去屋顶乘坐直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambassador, your documents. We're moving to the rooftop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.30,0:44:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大使女士 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Madame Ambassador, hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.30,0:44:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you are Elastigirl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.67,0:44:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定得跟你握握手\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why now I'm shaking your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.17,0:44:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前你被迫隐姓埋名 我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so sad when you went underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.30,0:44:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你现在身着华丽的超能装 重现于世 我真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am glad to see you back in your shiny outfit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.31,0:44:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,您跟我说这些我深受鼓舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means so much coming from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.71,0:44:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝您演讲顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with your speech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.04,0:44:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边 大使女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, Ambassador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.41,0:44:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让和平永存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring lasting peace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.75,0:44:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 你也要继续打击犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will, when you defeat evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.65,0:44:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.75,0:44:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,三…二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.29,0:44:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去十五年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}For over 15 years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.59,0:44:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人们一直隐姓埋名\N{\fnArial\fs30}superheroes have been in hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.19,0:44:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活在一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forced into it by a society{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.19,0:44:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愿意帮助 支持他们的社会\N{\fnArial\fs30}no longer willing to support them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.73,0:44:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That may soon be changing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.36,0:44:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为社会上出现了支持超人回归的运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}due to a growing movement to bring the Supers back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.80,0:44:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们请来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, fresh on the heels of her own{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.63,0:44:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车失控事件中力挽狂澜\N{\fnArial\fs30}heroic save of a runaway train…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.57,0:44:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,以闪亮形象出现在世人面前的 弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sporting a new look, is the superhero, Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.11,0:44:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎你 - 你好 查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome! - Hello, Chad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.44,0:44:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看来你的支持率很高啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the polls are going in your direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.61,0:44:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是 这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's true. Things are good…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.35,0:44:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.75,0:45:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.45,0:45:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注意到我了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have your attention?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.65,0:45:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Chad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.09,0:45:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然你注意到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.35,0:45:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出现在你的屏幕上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm appearing on your screen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.22,0:45:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,读着另一个屏幕上别人让我说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reading the words I'm saying off of another screen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.29,0:45:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏幕无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screens are everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.19,0:45:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏幕能控制我们的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are controlled by screens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.13,0:45:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而掌控者 就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And screens are controlled by me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.10,0:45:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screenslaver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.11,0:45:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制者这次采访\N{\fnArial\fs30}I control this broadcast…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.24,0:45:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也控制着坐在你面前的这个愚蠢的主持人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this idiotic anchorman you see before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.65,0:45:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.38,0:45:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号遭到劫持 我去检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signal's been hijacked. I'll check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.38,0:45:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 千万不要看屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at any monitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.15,0:45:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在空中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could hijack the ambassador's aerocade…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.42,0:45:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接劫持大使乘坐的直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}while it's still airborne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.72,0:45:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Elastigirl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.63,0:45:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的窗户 最近的窗户在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearest window! Where's the nearest window?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.54,0:45:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 弹力女超人去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, what's going on? - Where's Elastigirl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.41,0:45:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哪个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.65,0:46:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力女超人 你在这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elastigirl! What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.56,0:46:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大使现在有危险了 她乘坐的是哪架直升机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ambassador is in danger. Which chopper is she…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.89,0:46:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.90,0:46:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上去 尽量接近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow them and get me close!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.77,0:46:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧找个地方安全降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the sky, and touch down safely!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.51,0:46:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down! It's Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.15,0:46:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到座位上 大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in your seat, ma'am!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.43,0:46:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遭到了袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're under attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.56,0:46:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点去 快去保护大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, go! Protect the ambassador!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.90,0:46:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把舱门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.20,0:46:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快照她说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do as she says!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.44,0:46:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都会游泳吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you all swim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.54,0:46:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会的 - 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.53,0:47:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上就要弹射了 都别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to slingshot! Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.51,0:47:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right, ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.84,0:47:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm perfectly fine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.46,0:47:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,男生们都是混蛋 超能力最没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys are jerks and superheroes suck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.26,0:47:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.56,0:47:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就看了一眼我穿超能装的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He takes one look at me in that suit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.46,0:47:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天见到我的时候他就假装不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and decides to pretend he doesn't even know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.37,0:47:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是在保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's protecting himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.47,0:47:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他真的看到了你 还是忘掉比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he really did see you, it's best that he forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.34,0:48:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你也有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better for you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.27,0:48:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都记不清这些年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you how many memories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.38,0:48:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪瑞克消除了多少记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dicker's had to erase over the years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.68,0:48:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是有人发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when someone figured out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.48,0:48:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你妈妈超人身份的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}your mother's or my identity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.28,0:48:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是迪瑞克搞的鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Dicker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.62,0:48:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和他说了托尼的事 - 小倩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You told him about Tony! - Honey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.85,0:48:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为叫迪瑞克抹除了托尼的记忆 所以他才会忘了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had me erased from Tony's mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.30,0:48:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨死超能力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate superheroes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.01,0:48:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不要做超人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I renounce them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.35,0:48:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要做超人啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I renounce them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.93,0:48:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,姐这是青春期叛逆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she having adolescence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.00,0:48:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,最新的报告表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new report out today shows that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.66,0:48:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于决策问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it comes to decision-making…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.50,0:48:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们觉得 通过让猴子扔飞镖的方式做决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}people have more trust in a monkey{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.34,0:49:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,比让国会议员们决定更靠谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}throwing darts than Congress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.70,0:49:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了托尼 有抗议吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on, Tommy? A protest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.87,0:49:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人是来声援的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here in support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.98,0:49:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,声援？ 声援什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Support? Support of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.31,0:49:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是来声援你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in support of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.99,0:49:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming out. Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.62,0:49:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 哦天呢 真是太谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness. Thanks so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.39,0:49:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.53,0:49:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿的什么牌子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does your sign say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.93,0:49:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人应该合法化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supers should be legal now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.54,0:49:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说 你才知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to ya. Oh, what do ya know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.84,0:49:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦伍德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellenwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.94,0:49:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在想起回我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, now you wanna return my calls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.98,0:49:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,聊超人的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}about superheroes, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.34,0:49:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,过会我再联系你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. I'll have to call you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.04,0:49:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that felt good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.45,0:49:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利西亚 让那边别挂电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felicia, hold my calls, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.65,0:49:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,起作用啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! It's working!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.45,0:49:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大使今天刚刚发表了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, the ambassador made a big speech{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.59,0:49:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于超能力的重要演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}about superheroes today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.79,0:49:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来救人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out saving someone's life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.52,0:49:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是能给他们留下好印象的 想不到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes a good impression on them. Who knew, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.92,0:49:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接到了来自世界各地的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting calls from all over the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.43,0:49:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,媒体曝光率提高了72%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Media awareness is up 72%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.83,0:49:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,超能力合法化已经成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}The push for superhero legalization{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.93,0:49:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界名列前茅的潮流\N{\fnArial\fs30}is becoming a worldwide movement!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.93,0:50:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一阶段我还有个大计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have big plans for our next move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.83,0:50:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在还是举办一次海上峰会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have a summit at sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.67,0:50:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就用我们的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll use our ship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.77,0:50:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把世界各地的超人和领导人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll gather leaders and Supers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.01,0:50:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都请到船上去 - 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- from all over the world. - That's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.74,0:50:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.88,0:50:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴支持率上升\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy the numbers are up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.55,0:50:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴大使也支持合法化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy the ambassador is pro-superhero…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.65,0:50:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你高兴 我也很欣喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm happy you're happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.42,0:50:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你嘴上出很高兴 可是 我怎么感觉不到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hearing that you're happy, but why am I not feeling it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.69,0:50:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我还没有抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I didn't get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.42,0:50:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏霸还在外面害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screenslaver is still out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.83,0:50:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我按照他的游戏规则走 赢了这一轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I did was play his game and win this round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.66,0:50:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定不会善罢甘休\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna want more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.83,0:50:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他出手的时候 我们肯定输\N{\fnArial\fs30}and as long as he gets to play, he wins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.96,0:50:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做生意其中一条心得就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing I've learned in business?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.03,0:50:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好的享受当下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smell the flowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.97,0:50:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲜花难得开一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't bloom that often.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.50,0:50:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然将来你的墓碑上会写着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want on your tombstone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.97,0:50:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她操心到老\N{\fnArial\fs30}"She worried a lot"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.11,0:50:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, stop talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.11,0:50:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.58,0:50:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太令人兴奋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just so exciting, isn't it? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.59,0:50:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow. Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.52,0:50:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力女超人 你来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! Elastigirl, there you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.73,0:50:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 我没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - I didn't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.63,0:51:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦 你快振作一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get yourself together, Karen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.97,0:51:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是穿越侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, my superhero name is Voyd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.07,0:51:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是 很想感激你 那个 敢于站出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna thank you, for, like, for being you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.01,0:51:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 让我来展示一下我的超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what I can do, um, is this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.72,0:51:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.79,0:51:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常精彩 有多维度的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is impressive. Very interdimensional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.56,0:51:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前觉得自己被社会摈弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt like an outcast before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.76,0:51:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在 自从你勇敢现身之后我就觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, with you being you, I feel like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.90,0:51:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 做回自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay, me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.97,0:51:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用飞机把他们从世界各地接过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I flew them in from all over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.94,0:51:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前他们都不现身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've all been in hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.80,0:51:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有各种各样的超能力 身份长期保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have powers, secret identities…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.01,0:51:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给自己起了名号\N{\fnArial\fs30}and names they've given themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.88,0:51:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是人鹰侠 很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Screech. It's a pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.18,0:51:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直认为超人最好的榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always considered you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.58,0:51:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就应该是你这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the gold standard for superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.65,0:51:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您 您太客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks. You're too nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.79,0:51:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字叫 飞砖侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am called Brick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.69,0:51:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 你从哪里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you, Brick. Uh, where are you from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.06,0:51:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯康辛州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wisconsin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.63,0:52:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 弹力女超人 他想你的能力是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Elastigirl. I assume your powers are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.76,0:52:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,用电流进行打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, zapping things electrically…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.03,0:52:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,充电啊 发出闪电啊之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}charging things, bolts of lightning, that kind of stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.57,0:52:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫反胃侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's Reflux.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.04,0:52:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能觉得这其实是胃病 或是超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical condition or superpower, you decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.01,0:52:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是讲个笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a little line{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.64,0:52:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家轻松一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say just to put people at ease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.08,0:52:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope I don't offend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.21,0:52:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 你说的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no. Reflux. Love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.68,0:52:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很期待能跟你共事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I do look forward to working with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.58,0:52:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能力太棒了 保持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that is impressive. Keep practicing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.59,0:52:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴 今天很成功 祝贺你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm beat. Congratulations. Big day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.96,0:52:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 女士们 我们明天早上再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, ladies. I will see you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.53,0:52:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.83,0:52:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be nice for you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.54,0:52:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔了这么久再一次成为焦点\N{\fnArial\fs30}being out front after all this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.10,0:52:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为焦点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out front?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.67,0:52:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 毕竟上次当超人已经是很久之前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's been a while since your superhero days…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.24,0:52:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候 感觉你只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even then, you were kind of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.08,0:52:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,活在超能先生的阴影里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Mr. Incredible's shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.68,0:52:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此我可不敢苟同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I beg to differ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.11,0:52:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没说你不够耀眼 你很耀眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not… I'm not saying you weren't big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.12,0:52:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天你可算的上是超级巨星了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you were, and are, a superstar…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.12,0:52:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 现在的舞台是完全属于你一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have the stage to yourself now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.05,0:53:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们的注意力想不集中在你身上都难\N{\fnArial\fs30}And people have to pay attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.09,0:53:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你准备扯「这是个男人的世界」这套说辞咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean, "It's a man's world" and all that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.89,0:53:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你觉得现在的世界是怎么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what world do you live in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.76,0:53:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥是公司的总裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother runs DEVTECH.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.10,0:53:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不想做他的工作 我搞发明 他负责推销\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want his job. I invent, he sells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.23,0:53:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在问你 我们两个谁的影响力更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you, which of us has the greater influence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.80,0:53:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这人有两面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which side of me are you asking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.27,0:53:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,理想家 还是批评家 你想问哪一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}The believer or the cynic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.74,0:53:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,批评家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cynic…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.01,0:53:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我觉得 推销的工作更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would say selling is more important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.74,0:53:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为推销员越厉害 吸引的顾客越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}because the best sellers have the most buyers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.78,0:53:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至卖什么都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter what you're selling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.58,0:53:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是如何吸引人们来买\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only matters what people buy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.32,0:53:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.02,0:53:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有一天我能揭示宇宙起源的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I discovered the origin of the universe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.99,0:53:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥也能想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother would find a way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.62,0:53:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它包装成一种 足部按摩疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}to market it as a, uh, foot massager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.93,0:53:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 理想家会如何看待这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what would the believer say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.83,0:53:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,理想家认为 你要活出自己的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}The believer would tell you to make your mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.16,0:53:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用看别人的眼色表达自己 坚持自己的主张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wait for permission, assert yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.63,0:53:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,用自己的意志改变现状\N{\fnArial\fs30}and impose your will on the status quo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.14,0:53:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说话很像我哥哥 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sounds like my brother. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.00,0:53:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话很像我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.31,0:53:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他做的没错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's not wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.71,0:53:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想得到他人的回应 这可算得上一门技术活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is an art to getting a reaction…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.04,0:53:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么抓到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! I know how to get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.78,0:53:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓我哥哥么 - 不 我是说屏霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My brother? - No. Screenslaver!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.81,0:53:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是技术专家 我需要锁定某个信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're tech-savvy. I need to lock onto a signal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.62,0:53:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪它的来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}and trace its origin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.78,0:53:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最快要花多久能把所需的设备弄好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fast can you slap something together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.92,0:54:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后跟我在机场会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and meet me at the airport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.12,0:54:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.12,0:54:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要立马出城一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to go out of town, pronto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.89,0:54:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明早五点就能准备好设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get your contraption together by 5:00 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.06,0:54:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得上电视 联系查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get on TV. Chad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.16,0:54:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚就让我哥哥安排查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get my brother to set up an exclusive with him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.93,0:54:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在新闻节目里对你进行专访\N{\fnArial\fs30}tonight on the newscast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.10,0:54:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接用电话连线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish our interview by phone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.30,0:54:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,提高知名度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promote the hell out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.67,0:54:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱离屏霸的控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Independence from Screenslavery!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.07,0:54:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查德新闻频道 - 一举成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chad tonight. - Boom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.07,0:54:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是迪瑞克 - 嘿 迪瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dicker. - Yeah, hey, Rick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.74,0:54:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得我跟你提过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember that kid I mentioned to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.34,0:54:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叫托尼·莱丁格的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony Rydinger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.64,0:54:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个消除记忆的小男孩吧 记得那孩子看起来不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind wipe? Yeah, nice kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.35,0:54:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还消除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you also wiped out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.05,0:54:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他周五晚上要和我女儿巴小倩约会的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Friday night date my daughter had with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.05,0:54:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格说来他把小倩彻底忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, you wiped out my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.69,0:54:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这项技术还不成熟 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops. Not an exact science, Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.96,0:54:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 你一定得帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, you gotta help me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.83,0:54:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,小倩快恨死我了 还有你 恨超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violet hates me, and you, and superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.86,0:54:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得想办法补救一下 托尼的资料你手上有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta fix this. What do you know about Tony?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.77,0:54:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.23,0:54:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是个挺守规矩的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like a good kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.84,0:54:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,受欢迎 喜欢运动 音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Popular, plays sports, music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.00,0:54:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,父母开了家餐馆 叫「快乐拼盘」 他有时候也会在餐馆帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parents own The Happy Platter, kid works there part time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.84,0:54:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「快乐拼盘」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Platter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.71,0:54:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干嘛要开车跑这么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did we drive all the way across town{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.25,0:55:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这个「快乐拼盘」餐馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}for The Happy Platter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.05,0:55:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要那边的四人座 靠着树林的那个桌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like a booth over there, near the philodendron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.69,0:55:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很不错 坐在树林附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, right? Near the philodendron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.09,0:55:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个快乐餐馆 我看一点都不快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}This platter doesn't look all that happy to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.26,0:55:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来挺无聊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks bored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.23,0:55:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就成了无聊大拼盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha! The Bored Platter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.13,0:55:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得小倩肯定吃腻了路边的快餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Vi would want a change of pace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.70,0:55:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,要换换口味\N{\fnArial\fs30}from drive-in food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.87,0:55:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢吃路边的快餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like drive-in food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.77,0:55:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,换换口味该不是只吃蔬菜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean vegetables?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.74,0:55:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,营养要平衡就得吃蔬菜 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}A balanced diet means vegetables, kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.74,0:55:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要习惯多吃蔬菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get used to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.85,0:55:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.88,0:55:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.48,0:55:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没事吧 - 小倩 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is she all right? - Violet, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.09,0:55:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to see here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.29,0:55:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你需要更多餐巾纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, more napkins would be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.05,0:55:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事 我没事 - 这种情况总是会出现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm fine, I'm fine. - It happens all the time here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.19,0:55:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就擦干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mops it right up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.09,0:55:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她平时喝东西的时候 可没有这么激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normally, she doesn't ever drip like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.99,0:55:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们还要水吗 先生 - 要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you like water, sir? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.16,0:55:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来些水吧 这是我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I would. This is my daughter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.13,0:55:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一定认识的 对吧 - 我的天 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- who you must know, right? - God. Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.83,0:55:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 她叫小倩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Violet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.17,0:55:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 小倩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Violet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.47,0:55:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小倩 打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Vi, say hi to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.94,0:55:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't push it, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.31,0:55:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫巴小飞 是她弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dash, her little brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.31,0:55:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.48,0:55:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这水的味道真是不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. This is really good water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.95,0:56:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很是清新\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very refreshing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.25,0:56:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,山泉水 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spring water, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.12,0:56:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 先生 应该就是自来水吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, sir. I think it's tap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.02,0:56:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it is very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.79,0:56:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常棒的自来水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent tap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.19,0:56:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.33,0:56:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.16,0:56:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她干嘛去了 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd she go? - Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.89,0:56:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,找地方发火去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find a good place to be angry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.00,0:56:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我们要连线采访一位特别嘉宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, we go now to a special remote interview…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.90,0:56:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.10,0:56:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样 查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling, Chad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.14,0:56:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You doing all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.41,0:56:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 医生给我做了检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. The doctors checked me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.91,0:56:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不记得当时的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no memory of the event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.91,0:56:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,实话跟你说 看到录像里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta tell you, it's pretty strange{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.81,0:56:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几天的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see a recording…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.18,0:56:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己却一点印象都没有 感觉真的很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}of yourself the night before and have no recollection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.85,0:56:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think anyone needs to worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.42,0:56:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上我们的安全措施非常的严密\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've taken many precautions tonight though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.89,0:56:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.22,0:56:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在调查一个案子 在一个视野开阔 安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a case, in a secure undisclosed location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.26,0:56:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想先聊聊你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna talk about you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.96,0:56:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,先从最近救下失控列车的事迹开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}starting with your save of a runaway train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.36,0:56:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有一段独家的未经过编辑的录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's an exclusive unedited clip{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.93,0:56:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是装在你身上的摄像头记录下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from your own suit cam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.37,0:56:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,请播放录像吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roll the clip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.47,0:56:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车动起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing's really moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.24,0:56:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车的速度是160公里每小时 而且还在加速 已经建好的轨道有多长\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 and climbing. How much track is built?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.97,0:56:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多四十公里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 25 miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.91,0:57:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏霸中止了这个节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Screenslaver interrupts this program…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.11,0:57:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有重要的事情要宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}for an important announcement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.55,0:57:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,丫的 她猜中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned. She knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.45,0:57:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来就看你的设备管不管用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if your gadget works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.22,0:57:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的录像就不用看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother watching the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.49,0:57:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.99,0:57:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力女超人无法拯救城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elastigirl doesn't save the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.23,0:57:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是推迟了自己失败之日的到来而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}She only postpones her defeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.10,0:57:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可她至少还在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And while she postpones her defeat…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.30,0:57:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你们只会吃着薯片 看着她解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}you eat chips and watch her confront problems…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.97,0:57:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些你们自己懒得解决的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you are too lazy to deal with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.24,0:57:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人们满足了你们愚蠢的愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superheroes are part of your brainless desire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.14,0:57:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,用虚拟代替真实生活的愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}to replace true experience with simulation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.38,0:57:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会说话 只会看脱口秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't talk, you watch talk shows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.88,0:57:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天天就看那些有奖竞赛节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't play games, you watch game shows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.45,0:57:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅行 恋爱 冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travel, relationships, risk…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.52,0:57:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的这些有意义的人生经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}every meaningful experience must be packaged…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.46,0:57:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,都包装在电视节目里 供你们远远的观赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and delivered to you to watch at a distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.03,0:57:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们就能一直躲在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that you can remain ever sheltered…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.50,0:57:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,被动接受这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever passive…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.20,0:57:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了贪婪的消费者\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever ravenous consumers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.60,0:57:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直躺在沙发上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can't bring themselves to rise from their couches…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.61,0:58:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不努力 这都不是真正的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}break a sweat and participate in life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.04,0:58:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想受到超人们的保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want superheroes to protect you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.61,0:58:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你们也因为有人保护你们 变得越发软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make yourselves ever more powerless in the process.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.92,0:58:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们自认为 会有人照顾你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you tell yourselves you're being looked after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.45,0:58:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有人给你们开创美好未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That your interests are being served.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.59,0:58:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有人维护你们的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your rights are being upheld.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.46,0:58:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,长此以往 现有的体制一面榨干你们的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that the system can keep stealing from you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.60,0:58:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一面还对你们报以微笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}smiling at you all the while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.47,0:58:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀 叫你们的超人走狗们来阻止我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, send your Supers to stop me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.17,0:58:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就吃着零食 看看电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your snacks, watch your screens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.50,0:58:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see what happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.61,0:58:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已不再是局面的掌控者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are no longer in control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.64,0:58:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.79,1:00:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.24,1:01:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.78,1:01:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.28,1:01:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还问什么情况 你把那些证据都给毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened is you destroyed my evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.35,1:01:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事 我犯什么法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? What did I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.12,1:01:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些家伙要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you guys do to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.59,1:01:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害啊 你个小混混 还怪体制不行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, punk. Blame the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.36,1:01:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的追踪器太好用了 伊芙琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your tracker worked like a charm, Evelyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.26,1:01:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.53,1:01:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, shucks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.43,1:02:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是你这个天才背后的天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just the genius behind the genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.23,1:02:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.60,1:02:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天又开始学分数 小数和 百分数了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing fractions and denismals and percentages{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.60,1:02:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我题目做不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't get 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.67,1:02:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.81,1:02:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次不是学会了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't we get all caught up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.27,1:02:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我上次是学会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we were caught up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.71,1:02:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在学的是分数 百分数和小「书」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now we're doing fractions and percentages and demicels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.18,1:02:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小数不是小「书」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decimals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.55,1:02:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于超能跑车的最新情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the addition of the Incredibile, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.85,1:02:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它之前的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the super car…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.25,1:02:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那位著名的超人 超能先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}once driven by superhero, Mr. Incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.62,1:02:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意 只有等你富可敌国的时候才买得起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the kind of thing you buy when you have everything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.59,1:02:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说车子已经修不好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said it was beyond repair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.93,1:02:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 车的状态非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it was in perfect condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.46,1:02:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你原来的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to drive that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.26,1:02:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还说车子彻底毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said it was destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.76,1:02:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前人们以为这辆车已经被毁或者不翼而飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long thought lost or destroyed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.63,1:02:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这辆车还是出现在私人拍卖会上\N{\fnArial\fs30}the famous car turned up at private auction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.80,1:02:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说 车已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said it was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.30,1:02:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.21,1:02:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这愚蠢的瀑布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid water feature!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.68,1:02:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆车装有一些非常棒的配件\N{\fnArial\fs30}This car is just loaded with amazing gadgets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.45,1:02:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意介绍一下么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Care to demonstrate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.62,1:02:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望介绍给大家 但我们现在还没搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to, but we haven't figured out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.79,1:02:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何启动这些装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to make them work yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.29,1:03:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 是你在操控么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! It works?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.90,1:03:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么 小飞 这可不是你的玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? This is not a toy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.37,1:03:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你启动了火箭炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a rocket launcher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.64,1:03:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 按哪个键能发射火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet! Which one launches the rocket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.64,1:03:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又不是你的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! This is not your car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.37,1:03:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不是你的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your car, either!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.71,1:03:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的车 这是超能跑车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is so! It's the Incredibile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.51,1:03:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那车怎么在那个人手上 - 车不应该在他手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why's that guy have it? - He shouldn't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.54,1:03:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射火箭 火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launch the rockets! Launch the rockets!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.31,1:03:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭 发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launch the rockets!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.78,1:03:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不会乱发射火箭的 - 我要炸炸炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not launching anything! - I wanna blow it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.32,1:03:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会让那个有钱的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I want an angry rich guy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.39,1:03:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,来找我麻烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming after me right now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.89,1:03:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我都尽量不去 - 我都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- when I'm trying not to… - I'm not sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.62,1:03:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里是什么情况 马克 - 让你妈妈为我们分心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what's happened here, Mark. - Distract your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.69,1:03:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的人们都散开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But everyone here has scattered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.39,1:03:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该马上撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm afraid I'll need to move at any minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.29,1:03:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车在这有钱人手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich guy got my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.70,1:03:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 你不去把跑车\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're not gonna steal your car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.47,1:03:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那个有钱人那里偷回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}back from the rich guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.58,1:03:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the heck is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.38,1:03:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰居然有超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack-Jack has powers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.42,1:03:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.55,1:04:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你早就知道了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You knew about this? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.99,1:04:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么你不告诉我们 - 我说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't you tell us? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.82,1:04:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是你的孩子 我们有权知道这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're your kids. We need to know these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.36,1:04:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉妈妈了吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you tell Mom? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.66,1:04:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么不说 - 你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - Your mother is not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.56,1:04:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定是不想让我们不知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd want us to tell you, wouldn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.30,1:04:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么不告诉妈妈 - 因为我不想让她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why would you not tell Mom? - Because I didn't wanna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.63,1:04:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.84,1:04:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 爸爸 - 我现在还不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, man. - Because it's not the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.04,1:04:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么能这样 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.30,1:04:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样真不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So uncool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.41,1:04:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我还没想好怎么说 行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm formulating, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.54,1:04:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也刚知道这个事 我需要消化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking in information, I'm processing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.44,1:04:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要学做数学题 还要补救男朋友的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing the math, I'm fixing the boyfriend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.51,1:04:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要哄好小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keeping the baby{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.75,1:04:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得他变成喷火的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}from turning into a flaming monster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.98,1:04:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么同时做好这么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.38,1:04:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在努力适应环境 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}By rolling with the punches, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.55,1:04:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能胡乱做一通就完事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I eat thunder and crap lightning, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.29,1:04:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是著名的超能先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm Mr. Incredible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.86,1:04:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是能力不足先生 也不是一般般先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Mr. So-So or Mr. Mediocre-Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.40,1:04:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是超能先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Incredible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.60,1:04:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该找鲁修斯叔叔帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should call Lucius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.84,1:04:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我自己能处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I can handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.50,1:04:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不会去求…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way I'm gonna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.92,1:04:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.49,1:05:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去给鲁修斯叔叔打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling Lucius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.89,1:05:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看挺正常的 是什么时候开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks normal to me. When did this start happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.63,1:05:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,从何莉开始工作的时候开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since Helen got the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.66,1:05:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那她应该知道这事吧 - 你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I assume she knows? - Are you kidding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.60,1:05:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定不能跟她说这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell her about this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.90,1:05:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可在外面忙那些超人的工作呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}not while she's doing hero work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.43,1:05:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.74,1:05:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 加把劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.10,1:05:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么能光让男人们做拯救世界的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the saving the world to the men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.64,1:05:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得这样不行 - 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think so. - Mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.01,1:05:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要成功的照顾好孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to succeed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.88,1:05:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话 她在外面才能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she can succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.58,1:05:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以 咱们一家都能成功 - 我明白你的意思 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So we can succeed! - I get it, Bob!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.05,1:05:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有多久没睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. When was the last time you slept?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.02,1:05:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁还记得睡觉的事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who keeps track of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.85,1:05:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟他还只是婴儿而已嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, he's a baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.42,1:05:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能搞定的 我自己就能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle it, I got this handled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.79,1:05:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 你能搞定 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you good then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.72,1:05:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都尽在你掌握之中 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got everything under control? Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.96,1:05:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.50,1:05:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰宝宝 想吃饼干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cookie! Cha Cha want a cookie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.57,1:05:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吃的饼干 小杰宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Num-num cookie? Cha Cha wanna num-num?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.50,1:05:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吃的饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Num-num cookie! Cookie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.37,1:05:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没… - 饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not… - Cookie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.54,1:05:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吃的饼干 - 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God! - Cookie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.84,1:05:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 爸爸 - 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dada! Dada. Dada. - Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.65,1:06:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说他还能听见你 哪怕是在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he can still hear you from the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.62,1:06:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在四维空间也能听见 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the other dimension, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.65,1:06:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个很怪 感觉不太妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is freaky. I mean, that's not like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.75,1:06:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像我的那两个孩子 对 他就是不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like our other kids. No, it is not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.79,1:06:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满能量 随时随地都可能发动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full powers, totally random.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.49,1:06:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在他算是 在那吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now, he's what? Is he good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.83,1:06:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀 他看起来很好 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you'd think so, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.97,1:06:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我总不能一直给他吃饼干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, I can't keep giving him cookies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.07,1:06:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃呃 - 要是我不给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-uh? - But if I stop…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.61,1:06:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又在胡闹了 又在闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhh! He is freaking! Again, he is freaking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.61,1:06:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不准咬你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No biting the daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.11,1:06:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么… - 不准乱咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the…? - No biting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.05,1:06:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.89,1:06:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该只是需要一点时间做自己的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I just need a little bit of me time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.99,1:06:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就能好起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll be good to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.53,1:06:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是一点点时间的问题 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you need more than me time, Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.70,1:06:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要在许多方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need major life realignment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.60,1:06:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,调整自己的生活方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a number of levels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.83,1:06:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先就要想办法搞定这个小怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting with baby superfreak here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.60,1:06:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要的是新想法 而不是这些老套路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need some solid outside-the-box thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.02,1:07:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈尔巴基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Galbaki?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.62,1:07:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力女超人的超能装居然是找戈尔巴基做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elastigirl's supersuit is by Galbaki?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.69,1:07:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我好好解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.19,1:07:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 你怎么憔悴成这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. You're worse than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.96,1:07:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找你是因为小杰的事 我把他带过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the baby. I brought the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.64,1:07:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒是很少见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, highly unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.25,1:07:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脸色太差了 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look ghastly, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.05,1:07:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都没怎么睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't been sleeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.22,1:07:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我伤了女儿的心 也不会做新数学题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I broke my daughter, they keep changing math…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.92,1:07:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校要带五号电池 可我买成了二号电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}we needed double-A batteries, but I got triple-A's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.99,1:07:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还是没有五号电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now we still need double-A batteries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.93,1:07:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把红衣服和白衣服放在一起洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put one red thing in a load of whites{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.23,1:07:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果都洗成了粉色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now everything's pink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.53,1:07:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家鸡蛋也快没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think we need eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.80,1:07:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能把孩子养好 也是非常伟大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done properly, parenting is a heroic act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.57,1:07:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是养得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done properly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.07,1:07:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是 这个问题从来都没有困扰过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am fortunate that it has never afflicted me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.24,1:08:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来我这 不是为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you do not come to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.94,1:08:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要鸡蛋和电池的吧 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}for eggs and batteries, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.58,1:08:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是设计超能装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I design herowear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.98,1:08:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力女超人必须换一件新超能服\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Elastigirl must have a new suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.65,1:08:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这是为了小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.25,1:08:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想给小婴儿也做一件超能装么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You also wish a new suit for the baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.09,1:08:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他还小 应该没那么急着穿超能服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would hardly classify this as an emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.13,1:08:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这个是特殊情况 很值得研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's a special case. Worth studying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.90,1:08:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能不能把他放在你这一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could just leave him with you for a while…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.00,1:08:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说把他放在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him? Here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.93,1:08:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这人可不喜欢带孩子 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not a baby person, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.07,1:08:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这也没有孩子用的东西 我是个艺术家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no baby facilities. I am an artist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.04,1:08:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不会做这种琐碎又平庸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not involve myself in the prosaic day-to-day to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.08,1:08:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.72,1:08:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.12,1:08:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了吗 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you seeing this, Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.86,1:08:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.94,1:08:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.81,1:09:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.14,1:09:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然可以把小杰留在我这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you can leave the baby overnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.98,1:09:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,何莉不在家 你做家务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure filling in for Helen is challenging, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.71,1:09:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也一定也很累\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you are very tired…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.91,1:09:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个孩子也需要你照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the other children need you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.01,1:09:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想你了 赶紧回家去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and miss you, and you must go to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.72,1:09:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫衣娜阿姨会照顾好小杰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Auntie Edna will take care of everything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.15,1:09:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好开车注意安全 再见 感谢你的到访\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, drive safely and goodbye. I enjoy our visits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.62,1:09:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫衣娜 阿姨\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Auntie Edna"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.80,1:09:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意 请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention. Attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.10,1:09:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想感谢今晚到场的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna thank everyone that came out tonight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.77,1:09:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们支持超人事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}in support of superheroes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.17,1:09:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们得以重见天日\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bringing them back into society!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.77,1:09:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们推动了进步\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all made it happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.38,1:09:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的社会对超人的需要之迫切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The need for this has been made{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.81,1:09:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近尤为突出\N{\fnArial\fs30}crystal clear in recent days…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.18,1:09:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些跳梁小丑 比如那个自称屏霸的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}with bad actors like the self-proclaimed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.11,1:09:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,威胁着社会稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screenslaver threatening our peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.28,1:09:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他没闹腾多久就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His reign was short, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.88,1:09:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这一切要感谢这位女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thanks to this woman…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.99,1:09:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的超人 你们都爱她 也都想见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}a great super. You love her. You missed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.16,1:09:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.06,1:09:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上来 别害羞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on up here. Don't be bashful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.86,1:09:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 到台上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.27,1:10:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想把这个送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to have this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.07,1:10:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个纪念\N{\fnArial\fs30}A memento.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.84,1:10:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢温斯顿 伊芙琳 还有迪沃科技的全体员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Winston, Evelyn, and everyone at DEVTECH.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.21,1:10:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远感谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am forever in your debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.21,1:10:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也感谢到场的各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thanks to all of you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.95,1:10:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们的支持改变了大家对超人的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}your pressure changed all the right minds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.05,1:10:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在很短时间内取得了非常大的进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've made amazing headway in a very short time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.35,1:10:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我现在要宣布一个重要消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}which leads me to an important announcement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.82,1:10:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在刚才的一场世界级的峰会上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just now, at a worldwide summit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.02,1:10:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过一百个国家的领导人\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaders from more than a hundred{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.93,1:10:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经达成了共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the world's top countries…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.69,1:10:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,致力于推动超能力的合法化\N{\fnArial\fs30}have agreed to make superheroes legal again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.03,1:10:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll gather superheroes and leaders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.83,1:10:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界各地的领导人和超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}from all over the planet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.04,1:10:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,来到我们的正义号轮船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}on our boat, the Everjust…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.84,1:10:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加国际协定的签署仪式 全程通过直播\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a televised signing ceremony at sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.21,1:10:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在各位别耽搁了 大家赶快上船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if you'll excuse us, we got a ship to catch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.28,1:10:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 谢谢你能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So good to see you. Thanks for coming out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.68,1:10:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hi, it's me, again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.69,1:10:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我一直想问你个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, there's, uh, something I've always wanted to ask you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.82,1:10:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么平衡超人工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, how do you balance the superhero stuff{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.39,1:10:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,和日常生活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the life stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.19,1:10:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能处理好超人的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I can handle the superhero stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.74,1:11:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我有事要稍微离开一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you please excuse me a moment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.74,1:11:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 那一会再聊 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Yeah, okay, see you later! Good talk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.03,1:11:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 小倩 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Vi. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.40,1:11:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰怎么没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Jack-Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.87,1:11:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫衣娜夫人会照顾他\N{\fnArial\fs30}E's taking him for a little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.07,1:11:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莫衣娜会看孩子么 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Edna is babysitting? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.84,1:11:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就把小杰留给他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're okay with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.91,1:11:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也不知道为什么但我就这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I don't know why, but yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.25,1:11:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些话想跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to say something to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.98,1:11:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼的事 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.39,1:11:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到迪瑞克会抹掉托尼的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think about Dicker erasing his memory…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.36,1:11:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没想到 你要为你自己从没做过的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}or about you having to pay the price for a choice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.03,1:12:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,付出代价 这不公平 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never made. It's not fair, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.96,1:12:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来在餐馆里 我又雪上加霜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, I made it worse at the restaurant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.03,1:12:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}by trying to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.50,1:12:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正 不管怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway. Anyway…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.50,1:12:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.37,1:12:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去我一直很确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm used to knowing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.94,1:12:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己做的事情是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the right thing to do is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.84,1:12:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在我说不好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now, I'm not sure anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.01,1:12:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想当一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.35,1:12:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}a good dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.52,1:12:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是一般的好爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.83,1:12:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是超级好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're super.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.04,1:12:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人在工作的时候允许喝一点酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are superheroes allowed to drink on duty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.01,1:12:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在绝对不是在工作 虽然穿着制服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm definitely not on duty. Ignore the costume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.14,1:12:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我应该上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I should be up there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.28,1:12:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过总和人微笑握手我有些累了 我想清静一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I had to step away from the grip and grins, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.48,1:12:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人才能平静下来 我也是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta get away to keep it pure. I know I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.89,1:12:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在躲着什么人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you getting away from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.39,1:12:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是公司那些人 主要是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, you know, company stuff. My brother, mostly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.96,1:13:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很爱他呀 你们俩就是公司的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you love him, you two are this company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.96,1:13:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,阴阳两面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yin and yang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.33,1:13:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我做发明 他和人打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I invent the stuff, he's good at people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.46,1:13:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们高兴 搞清楚他们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasing them, engaging them, figuring out what they want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.00,1:13:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不懂人们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never know what people want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.14,1:13:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think they want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.27,1:13:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.34,1:13:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们每次都会放弃质量 选择轻松的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will trade quality for ease every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.28,1:13:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西很差 不过你看它们方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may be crap, but hey, it's convenient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.88,1:13:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次的案子也有这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Kind of like this case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.58,1:13:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么 屏霸的这个案子么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? The Screenslaver?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.92,1:13:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 有些事情不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, something's not sitting right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.62,1:13:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was too easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.15,1:13:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住屏霸简单 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was too easy? Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.53,1:13:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有意思 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Funny. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.56,1:13:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.16,1:13:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏霸藏身的地方有一块屏幕 连通了我身上的摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of Screenslaver's monitors is tuned into my suit cam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.30,1:13:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.24,1:13:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个摄像头不是闭路连接的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't the suit cam closed circuit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.37,1:13:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.14,1:13:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么在屏霸那会有图像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how come Screenslaver has it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.01,1:13:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他黑进了系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he hacked it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.48,1:13:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说他有能力黑进闭路系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he's sophisticated enough to do that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.18,1:13:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏身处却只挂了一把锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he has simple locks on his doors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.95,1:13:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他是有意让你找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he wanted you to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.98,1:13:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是想让自己被抓吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to get caught?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.45,1:13:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是想让你赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted you to win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.42,1:14:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这不合逻辑 他是个聪明的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes no sense. He's a brilliant guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.92,1:14:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明到能发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's smart enough to conceive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.19,1:14:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们安装的闭路摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}of technology like this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.66,1:14:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能用自己的技术黑进闭路系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's smart enough to think of something to do with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.20,1:14:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓的那个人是个送披萨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy we put in jail delivered pizzas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.33,1:14:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.30,1:14:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦还是职员呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Einstein was a patent clerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.10,1:14:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着你已经赢了 你抓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you won. You got the guy who…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.24,1:14:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏霸要想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. All Screenslaver needs to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.61,1:14:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对人进行催眠 控制人的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hypnotize someone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.01,1:14:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要那个人眼前有屏幕就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}is get a screen in front of their eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.11,1:14:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那块屏幕长的不像普通的屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if the screen doesn't look like a screen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.48,1:14:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 他真的就是送披萨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the pizza guy is really a pizza guy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.02,1:14:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他被眼睛前的屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he was controlled by the screens{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.32,1:14:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制了 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}built into his glasses…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.96,1:14:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.07,1:14:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the robot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.10,1:14:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,起飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's taking off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.50,1:14:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这还没有看到读数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not getting a reading yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.30,1:14:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 按下开火么 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Press "fire"? - Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.34,1:14:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,加大马力\N{\fnArial\fs30}More power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.24,1:14:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这能行 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hope this works, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.21,1:14:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想着让你一直睡到自然醒比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was best to just let you sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.11,1:14:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你足足睡了十七个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventeen hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.05,1:15:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.42,1:15:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.52,1:15:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 成功了爸爸 - 好耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it, Dad. - Hurray!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.49,1:15:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚你帮我照看小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you how much I appreciate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.53,1:15:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知道怎么感谢你才好 莫衣娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}you watching Jack-Jack for me, E.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.60,1:15:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 你的感激之情我已经心领了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm sure your gratitude is quite inexpressible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.03,1:15:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次别找我了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask me to do it again, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.67,1:15:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的要价可是很高的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My rates are far too high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.30,1:15:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑的 鲍勃 你给我的任务很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am joking, Robert. I enjoyed the assignment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.74,1:15:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰很聪明 我又善于引导\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is bright and I am stimulating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.68,1:15:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相处的很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We deserve each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.71,1:15:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小家伙有多种变形能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your child is a polymorph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.08,1:15:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他孩子一样他也有很大的潜力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like all babies, he has enormous potential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.42,1:15:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经知道有不少超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not unknown for supers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.22,1:15:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有不止一种能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have more than one power when young…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.05,1:15:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小家伙 有很多种\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this little one has many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.69,1:15:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的呦 有很多种能力呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you have many powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.47,1:15:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解你睡不好觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand your lack of sleep{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.71,1:15:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也说不清楚话鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}and coherency, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.18,1:15:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看孩子很累人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babies can be anything, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.65,1:15:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家的孩子也绝不是例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your child is no exception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.31,1:16:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身上可有无限的潜能 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has pure, unlimited potential, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.22,1:16:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚他睡了之后我充满灵感的疯狂工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He slept while I worked in a creative fever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.29,1:16:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫衣娜阿姨可是一整夜没睡哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Auntie Edna stayed up all night…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.69,1:16:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了让小宝贝变得漂漂亮亮的哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}making sure you look fabulous in your many forms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.46,1:16:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么情况 你怎么把他放进了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you… You're putting him in the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.16,1:16:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,展示柜 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the chamber, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.40,1:16:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是展览的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is part of the demonstration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.20,1:16:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.33,1:16:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的难题是要带一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your challenge is to manage a baby{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.33,1:16:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多种超能力的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has multiple powers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.10,1:16:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是没有办法控制他 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no control over them, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.24,1:16:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总结的很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. That sums it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.74,1:16:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我工作的时候听音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I often work to music{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.28,1:16:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现小杰对我听的音乐很感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I noticed the baby responds to it as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.21,1:16:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是听 莫扎特的音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Specifically, Mozart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.22,1:16:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了凯夫拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I blended Kevlar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.72,1:16:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,和碳炔材料来增加衣物强度\N{\fnArial\fs30}with carbyne for durability under duress…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.09,1:16:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用棉质材料提高舒适度\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cotton for comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.75,1:16:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在材料中还配备了微型的传感器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interwoven with these fabrics are a mesh of tiny sensors…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.33,1:16:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,监控他的身体情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}that monitor the baby's physical properties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.39,1:16:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不天啊 他在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lord! What is he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.43,1:16:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是听到了莫扎特的音乐就分身的 鲍勃 这可没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's Mozart, Robert. Can you blame him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.50,1:16:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是衣服上的传感器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The important thing is that the suit and tracker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.80,1:16:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以预测他要分身 并且提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}anticipated the change and alerted you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.11,1:16:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.21,1:16:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得回去拿饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get cookies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.71,1:16:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不需要饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not need cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.68,1:16:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚已经得到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I learned quite painfully{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.81,1:17:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉痛的教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}last night…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.15,1:17:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想通过给他饼干解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}any solution involving cookies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.72,1:17:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后都会让他变成恶魔宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}will inevitably result in the demon baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.69,1:17:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Combustion imminent"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.22,1:17:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.36,1:17:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是要着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means fire, Robert, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.13,1:17:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过超能装置有微型的灭火设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}for which the suit has countermeasures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.36,1:17:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你赶紧把这孩子身上的火灭掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you extinguish the baby's flames{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.23,1:17:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我屋里的烟雾警报器就要响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he trips the sprinkler system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.27,1:17:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我用的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flame retardant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.10,1:17:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑莓薰衣草味的阻燃剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}is blackberry lavender, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.31,1:17:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,见效快 可食用 而且非常美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Effective, edible, and delicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.21,1:17:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大开眼界 这个还真是管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you know? That is useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.48,1:17:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我的作品远远的超过了你的预期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, I have doubtlessly exceeded your expectations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.38,1:17:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且只用了一个晚上的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a single night's work…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.39,1:17:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这套衣服还是有几点问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}the suit and device contain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.69,1:17:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我们进一步讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few more features we need to discuss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.89,1:17:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 莫衣娜 谢谢你做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks again, E, for everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.49,1:17:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该你给你多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do I owe you for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.23,1:17:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别来这套 只要保证我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pish-posh, darling. Your bill will be covered by my fee…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.20,1:17:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,超能先生 弹力女超人 和破冰侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}for being Mr. Incredible, Elastigirl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.30,1:17:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在全宇宙范围里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Frozone's exclusive designer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.70,1:17:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一个超能装设计师 期限是永远永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}throughout the known universe and until the end of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.37,1:17:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于照顾这个小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But babysitting this one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.41,1:17:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我分文不取 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do for free, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.86,1:18:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would resist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.20,1:18:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会随意乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}the temptation to stretch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.50,1:18:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的气温比冰点还要低很多度\N{\fnArial\fs30}The temperature around you is well below freezing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.60,1:18:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你乱动的话 胳膊会断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to stretch and you'll break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.37,1:18:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么看来你才是真的屏霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're the Screenslaver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.17,1:18:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是 也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes and no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.51,1:18:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是说我创造了这个形象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say, I created the character{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.31,1:18:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提前录下了他要说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pre-recorded the messages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.21,1:18:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Winston know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.58,1:18:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问他知道我是屏霸吗 他当然不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'm the Screenslaver? Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.52,1:18:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是拿到了我的催眠技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine what Mr. Free Enterprise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.95,1:18:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了盈利还不知道要做出什么事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}would do with my hypnosis technology?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.76,1:18:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要做的事 难道会比你做的更坏么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse than what you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.42,1:18:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在利用技术来破除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm using the technology{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.56,1:18:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们对技术的迷信和过度依赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}to destroy people's trust in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.40,1:18:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我利用超人们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I'm using superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.83,1:18:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住的那个人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did I put in jail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.40,1:18:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是个送披萨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pizza delivery guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.67,1:18:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身高体重很合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seemed the right height, build.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.47,1:18:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让你好好的表演了一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave you a pretty good fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.77,1:19:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说是我通过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should say I gave you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.37,1:19:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你好好的表演了一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}a pretty good fight through him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.74,1:19:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个无辜的人进了监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't bother you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.51,1:19:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不在乎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that an innocent man is in jail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.41,1:19:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的态度很差的 披萨都凉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, he was surly and the pizza was cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.65,1:19:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来很信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I counted on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.38,1:19:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.82,1:19:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.39,1:19:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要信任我呢 因为我给了你摩托车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you count on me? Because I built you a bike?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.92,1:19:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我哥哥正好会唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because my brother knows the words{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.43,1:19:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹力女超人的那首主题曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}to your theme song?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.53,1:19:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谁也不了解谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.26,1:19:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你仍然可以信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can count on me anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.87,1:19:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该信任你对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am supposed to, aren't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.63,1:19:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你有奇怪的超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you have some strange abilities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.24,1:19:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还穿着闪亮的超能装\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a shiny costume…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.47,1:19:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这些人就应该无条件的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rest of us are supposed to put our lives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.91,1:19:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把性命交到你双手里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}into your gloved hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.94,1:19:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲就是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what my father believed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.48,1:19:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有强盗想闯进我们家里的时候 我妈妈想藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When our home was broken into, my mother wanted to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.25,1:19:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我劝我父亲去安全屋里躲躲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begged my father to use the safe room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.55,1:19:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但父亲坚持要给那些超人朋友打电话求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Father insisted they call his superhero friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.96,1:19:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果死了 死的毫无意义 而且愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died, pointlessly, stupidly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.76,1:19:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,临死前还在等着超人来拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for heroes to save the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.43,1:19:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why would you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.83,1:19:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你哥哥 - 他就是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your brother… - Is a child!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.03,1:19:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他记得以前那个时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}He remembers the time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.70,1:20:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有父母 而且有超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we had parents and superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.84,1:20:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是他就像个孩子一样 搞不清两者的区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, like a child, Winston conflates the two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.78,1:20:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈和爸爸丧生了 一定是因为超人离开导致的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy and Daddy went away because supers went away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.55,1:20:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我善良的父母真是傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our sweet parents were fools{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.32,1:20:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己的性命交到了一个超人的手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put their lives in anybody else's hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.42,1:20:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了超人我们反而更软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superheroes keep us weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.32,1:20:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna kill me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.76,1:20:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.79,1:20:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用你更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using you is better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.33,1:20:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以帮助我让超人们永远不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna help me make supers illegal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.33,1:20:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,重见天日\N{\fnArial\fs30}forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.81,1:20:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dada. Dada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.34,1:20:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗 激光眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready? Laser eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.95,1:20:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.01,1:20:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 好酷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow! - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.45,1:20:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 穿上这个 - 很棒 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yay, Jack-Jack! - Yeah, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.72,1:20:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's not all. Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.98,1:20:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰 激光眼准备好了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack-Jack, blaster ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.52,1:20:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会吧 - 这真是太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No way. - That is crazy cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.63,1:20:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来 让我先用他开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}My turn. I get to blast him first!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.93,1:20:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我来试试 我要玩嘛 - 把他给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me try. I want him. - Give him to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.33,1:20:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我只是展示一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm just demonstrating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.76,1:20:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在咱们家里不许让宝宝随意开火 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No firing the baby around the house, you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.77,1:21:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样玩 很可能会有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is potentially dangerous…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.44,1:21:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们要教他控制自己的力量 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're trying to teach him to control his powers, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.57,1:21:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,先停下 看屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. See the screen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.44,1:21:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他消失了 简直太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He vanished! That's really cool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.95,1:21:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 很好 看着屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good. Use the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.51,1:21:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是现在的读数 点一下 看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the current readout. Click it. See the readout?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.42,1:21:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四维度 看到了这个形状没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dimension four. See the shape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.38,1:21:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们家 看到他的相对位置了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the room. See where he is in relation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.35,1:21:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,找找他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.92,1:21:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's… there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.49,1:21:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的出来吧 好吃的饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Come out. Num-num cookie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.40,1:21:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 小杰最棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Jack-Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.73,1:21:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's really cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.91,1:21:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 弹力女超人有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Elastigirl's in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.38,1:21:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What happened to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.68,1:21:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉告诉你这个坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to tell you on the phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.38,1:21:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来迪沃科技的船上找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me on our ship at DEVTECH.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.82,1:21:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪沃科技的船 我十五分钟后到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ship at DEVTECH. I'll be there in 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.98,1:21:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪沃科技的船 什么事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's at the ship at DEVTECH?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.42,1:21:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲁修斯么 我是鲍勃 何莉有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucius? Bob. Helen's in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.95,1:21:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙照看孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need someone to watch the kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.69,1:21:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上超能服 情况可能不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit up. It might get weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.39,1:21:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上去 尽快 最多一刻钟就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there. ASAP. Fifteen tops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.96,1:21:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going ASAP?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.96,1:21:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better be back ASAP!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.60,1:22:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰那衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}And leaving that suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.83,1:22:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先走了 很快就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go. I'll be home soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.63,1:22:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁修斯叔叔马上到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucius will be here sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.97,1:22:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许在家里用小杰开炮玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No firing the baby around the house, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.14,1:22:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪沃科技的船上到底有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's at the ship at DEVTECH?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.91,1:22:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出去干嘛还要穿超能装啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why are you in your Supersuit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.45,1:22:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是妈妈的超能装吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Mom's supersuit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.86,1:22:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许要用 说不好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She may need it. You never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.89,1:22:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.59,1:22:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸刚才说鲁修斯叔叔会过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but Dad called Lucius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.60,1:22:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像听到妈妈的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}after getting a call about Mom…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.60,1:22:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后他就出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.87,1:22:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你不会再做超人了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you renounced superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.63,1:22:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 之前的话当我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I renounce my renunciation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.87,1:22:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它穿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.12,1:22:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello there, little fella.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.85,1:22:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.49,1:22:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在家不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kids aren't safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.72,1:22:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪沃公司叫我来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Deavors sent us to take you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.96,1:22:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用这么多人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, isn't that redundant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.83,1:23:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪沃先生叫我来保护好房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Deavors just sent me here to guard the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.10,1:23:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为孩子们不太安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause the kids aren't safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.84,1:23:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能人员安排上出了点问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it, managerial screw-up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.80,1:23:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉文斯顿我来搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Winston I handled it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.24,1:23:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你是 超夜侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand, Ms…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.91,1:23:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿越侠女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voyd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.18,1:23:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿越侠女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Voyd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.01,1:23:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,路上注意安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive safely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.79,1:23:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 老板交代我们也要带上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, he wants us to bring you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.83,1:23:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.53,1:23:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样拖不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}That isn't gonna hold them long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.03,1:23:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小飞 带小杰走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dash, grab the baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.50,1:23:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,分头去追\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.84,1:23:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.55,1:23:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,小飞开车走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get to my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.22,1:24:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.29,1:24:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little fella!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.15,1:24:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.55,1:24:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人跑车 打开窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredibile, windows down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.96,1:24:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dive in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.67,1:24:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是超人跑车 准备设置声控指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredibile, set voice identification.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.14,1:24:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,请大声的说出你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loudly, say your names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.67,1:24:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴小倩 - 巴小飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Violet Parr. - Dashiell Robert Parr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.91,1:24:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.98,1:24:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人跑车 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredibile, escape!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.26,1:25:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill me in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.76,1:25:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一条好消息 一条坏消息 找到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news and bad news. We found her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.66,1:25:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体应该没有受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seems physically fine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.03,1:25:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她遇到屏霸 交手一次后\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she's had an encounter with Screenslaver…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.73,1:25:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,行为就有些奇怪了 她在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's acting kind of strange. In here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.77,1:25:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么个奇怪法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.31,1:25:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.28,1:25:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷莉 你干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helen, what are you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.66,1:25:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷莉 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helen, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.88,1:25:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,超能跑车 路边停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredibile, pull over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.42,1:26:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能去找衣夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't go to E's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.36,1:26:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他们给鲁修斯叔叔带的眼镜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw those goggles they put on Lucius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.93,1:26:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些超人们 他们都带眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were wearing them, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.89,1:26:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定都是被某个人控制了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all under someone's control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.73,1:26:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人很可能也是这样控制了妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've probably done the same to Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.73,1:26:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有坏蛋在追我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Bad guys after us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.90,1:26:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有妈妈 没有妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Mom, no Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.71,1:26:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有鲁修斯叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Lucius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.91,1:26:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们有超能力 还有这辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have our powers, this car…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.41,1:26:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and… what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.03,1:26:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,超能跑车 带我们去迪沃科技大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredibile, take us to DEVTECH.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.10,1:26:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那几个孩子坐跑车逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids have escaped in a tricked-out car, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.47,1:26:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们抓住了酷冰侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we got Frozone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.00,1:26:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上把他带到正义号上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him to the ship at DEVTECH immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.35,1:27:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,船开走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, we missed 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.45,1:27:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是超能跑车能帮我追上那艘船就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I wish the Incredibile could follow that boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.76,1:27:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干了什么 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you do? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.29,1:27:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到底干了什么 - 我什么都没干\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you do? - I didn't do anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.90,1:27:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说什么这车就做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, this car does anything I say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.78,1:27:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在情况可不太妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't plan this well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.52,1:27:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会 我们都到这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? We're here, aren't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.19,1:27:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们是在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.79,1:27:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们需要去的是上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to be up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.16,1:27:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.33,1:27:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆超能跑车会不会正好配备了弹射座椅\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the Incredibile has ejector seats?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.80,1:27:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 什么 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.20,1:27:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 不 别再乱说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, baby! - No, don't say any more…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.93,1:27:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大功率 发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max power! Launch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.88,1:27:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.38,1:28:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 很高兴你们能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello! Glad you could come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.05,1:28:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来参加仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the conference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.36,1:28:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的主角们都去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our stars, where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.16,1:28:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,仪式就要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The event's about to start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.47,1:28:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不想抢了其他人的风头\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't want to upstage the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.50,1:28:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,签字仪式开始后 他们会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll join for the signing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.00,1:28:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎登船今天我们有特别节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, guests! You're in for a treat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.51,1:28:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的正义号是整地球上最大的一艘水翼船\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ship is the largest hydrofoil on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.14,1:28:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以大家要抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, hold onto something…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.28,1:28:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们马上就要出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we're going to open her up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.27,1:28:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须找到妈妈和爸爸 你待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find Mom and Dad. Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.94,1:28:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna search for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.14,1:28:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 不是你看着小杰吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Who's gonna watch Jack-Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.58,1:29:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别废话了 我很快就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck it up. I won't be long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.61,1:29:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等…等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait, but, but wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.28,1:29:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着巴小飞 爸爸妈妈有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is important. They are in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.08,1:29:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,全靠我们了 靠我们了 你能明白吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to us. To us, understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.02,1:29:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧好好哄哄他 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep him amused but quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.97,1:29:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! Quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.31,1:29:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack-Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.15,1:29:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰 小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack-Jack? Jack-Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.46,1:30:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack-Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.33,1:30:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那几个超人不知道我们在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mesmerized supers know we're here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.23,1:30:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我找到了爸爸妈妈 小杰去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I found Mom and Dad… Where's Jack-Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.20,1:30:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他丢了 我就让你干这么一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost him? I gave you one thing to do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.37,1:30:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有办法 有追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tracker. Use the tracker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.04,1:30:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在往上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.24,1:30:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是在电梯里 - 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's in an elevator. - Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.35,1:30:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿小朋友 你爸妈在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, little baby. Where are your parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.55,1:30:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here they are, folks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.52,1:30:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他们让这一切变为可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}The supers who started this whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.42,1:30:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了他们会准时到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you they'd be there in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.43,1:30:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给他们做新面具了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did you make them new masks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.13,1:30:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 夜视功能什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Night vision, et cetera…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.10,1:30:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好看 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look good, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.47,1:30:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单的 他都会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So simple, even he can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.24,1:31:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备直播 倒计时 三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're back live in three, two, one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.24,1:31:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个历史性的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a momentous occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.01,1:31:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天所要完成的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all managed to accomplish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.64,1:31:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当今世界上一项罕见的壮举\N{\fnArial\fs30}something extraordinarily rare in today's world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.15,1:31:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我们达成了共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agree on something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.08,1:31:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要撤销一个错误的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agree to undo a bad decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.19,1:31:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让来自\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.49,1:31:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界各国的少数\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few extraordinarily gifted members…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.39,1:31:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,超能力拥有者在社会上得到公平对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the world's many countries are treated fairly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.19,1:31:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要邀请他们用自己的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}To invite them once again to use their gifts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.56,1:31:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,造福世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}to benefit the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.07,1:31:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要感谢到场的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank all of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.57,1:31:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们代表了各个国家对超人的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}for representing your nation's commitment to superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.44,1:31:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特别要感谢塞立克大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}With special thanks to Ambassador Selick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.01,1:31:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没关系 尽情鼓掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's okay. Let her hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.71,1:31:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.18,1:31:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您 大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Ambassador, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.48,1:31:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的支持来的最早也非常关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your early and very crucial support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.61,1:31:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕没有任何一个人比您更适合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't think of anyone more deserving than you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.35,1:31:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个在国际超人协定上\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be the first signature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.19,1:31:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,签上自己的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the International Superhero Accord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.36,1:31:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我签好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.17,1:32:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy cow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.08,1:32:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道是着火了 赶快给我灭掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he's on fire. Just put him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.08,1:32:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.30,1:32:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,把遥控器给他没事么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it okay to give him that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.76,1:32:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你还有什么别的好办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't hearing any better ideas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.79,1:32:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.53,1:33:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.26,1:33:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.53,1:33:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃饼干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cookie num-num?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.28,1:33:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 妈妈 - 我看到他了 他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mama, Mama. - I see him. He's getting away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.12,1:33:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.32,1:33:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丫的 - 他是去找妈妈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Darn it! - He's heading for Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.86,1:33:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,签署完成了 超人得以重见天日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is done. The world is super again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.57,1:33:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,来合个影 来吧 大家来合影了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Group photo. Come on. Group photo, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.24,1:33:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,站近一点 历史性的一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squeeze in. That's it. Historic occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.17,1:33:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵 大家笑一笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.32,1:33:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始第二步行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on phase two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.29,1:33:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来我们遭到压迫 如同过街老鼠般\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years of mandated hiding and silence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.69,1:33:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这使得我们超人群体对社会充满愤恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}have made us bitter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.32,1:33:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在让我们重见天日\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bring us out into the light…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.19,1:34:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你们缺乏自制力\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to clean up the messes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.49,1:34:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法解决自己造成的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}your lack of discipline creates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.56,1:34:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的身体和精神都太过软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bodies and your character are weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.20,1:34:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的承诺都是空谈 你们会为此付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your promises are empty, and you will pay for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.87,1:34:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不在为你们而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We no longer serve you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.74,1:34:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只为自己而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We serve only us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.34,1:34:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有强大才能生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the fittest survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.74,1:34:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.78,1:34:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来直播出现了一些情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some very alarming moments there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.55,1:34:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是有些技术问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the, uh, technical difficulties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.35,1:34:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please bear with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.77,1:34:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,设呢么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.43,1:34:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救 求救 求救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayday! Mayday! Mayday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.94,1:34:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 让他说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold! Let him talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.50,1:34:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有超人闯进来占领了驾驶舱 重复一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superheroes have forcibly taken the bridge. Repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.51,1:34:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.69,1:34:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,再转\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.29,1:35:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,再转 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little further. Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.90,1:35:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况 一个宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the… A baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.46,1:35:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈 鲁修斯叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom and Dad. Uncle Lucius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.94,1:35:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 妈妈 - 小杰 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My mama. - Jack-Jack, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.71,1:35:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有超能力的宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}A super baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.38,1:35:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.82,1:35:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把他放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.62,1:35:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住她 - 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grab her! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.29,1:35:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱着小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.66,1:35:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.60,1:35:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.47,1:35:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我也是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what I thought last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.87,1:35:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 你们怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids, what are you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.38,1:35:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来救我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.98,1:35:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别生我们的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.35,1:35:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 好孩子 我怎么可能生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sweetie, how could I be mad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.72,1:35:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是很骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.02,1:36:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不是想打扰你们温馨的团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to break up a tender moment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.89,1:36:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们这是在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.39,1:36:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是迪沃科技的船吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this DEVTECH's ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.86,1:36:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伊芙琳那个家伙创造了屏霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn Deavor controls the Screenslaver…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.86,1:36:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且刚才她还控制了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and until a second ago, us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.66,1:36:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the crew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.73,1:36:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰撞即将发生 请调整航线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collision detected. Correct course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.93,1:36:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我干的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh. Did I do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.33,1:36:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你的超能服 换上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, the suit? Try this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.74,1:36:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三步 现在执行第三步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phase Three. Go on Phase Three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.58,1:36:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们怎么在这 你难道没去我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are the kids here? You didn't go to the house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.95,1:36:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了你家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.35,1:36:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没逃走吗 你们怎么没逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't escape? How did you not escape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.72,1:36:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我们刚救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! We just saved you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.92,1:36:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃走 谁在逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escape? Escape from who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.89,1:36:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.63,1:36:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰居然有超能力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…? Jack-Jack has powers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.37,1:36:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 打完了再跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know. Fight now, talk later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.67,1:37:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.41,1:37:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,激光眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laser eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.57,1:37:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跟我来 温斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me, Winston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.61,1:37:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的头好晕啊 - 你在这很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did I faint? - You'll be safe here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.57,1:37:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全 这里怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe? Safe from what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.68,1:37:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些外交官们呢 超…超人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the diplomats? The supers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.95,1:38:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在催眠呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still hypnotized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.08,1:38:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都干了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.72,1:38:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊芙琳逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn, she's escaping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.92,1:38:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就…快去追她啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, go after her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.96,1:38:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成你的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish your mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.76,1:38:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能就这么走了 孩子怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just go! What about the kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.46,1:38:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小杰呢 谁来照顾 - 妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack-Jack, who's gonna… - Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.07,1:38:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去 我们能搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. We've got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.70,1:38:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿越侠 你跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voyd, come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.60,1:38:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去关闭发动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go shut down the engine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.01,1:38:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去船头想办法让船减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try to slow the ship from the bow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.67,1:38:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 有个人不见了 那个挤压东西的家伙去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, someone's missing. Where's the crusher guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.61,1:38:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,系上安全带 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strap in now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.83,1:38:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for your own good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.80,1:38:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.50,1:38:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.91,1:39:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们太迟了 - 送我上飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're too late. - Get me up to the jet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.51,1:39:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这是你干的 你能把这些复原吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you did this. Can you undo it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.24,1:39:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我反碾压一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to un-crush?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.58,1:39:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 没人这么要求过我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No one's ever asked for that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.21,1:39:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 反碾压太傻了 干嘛要反碾压\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. To un-crush is silly. Why un-crush?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.22,1:39:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要进引擎室\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get into the engine room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.82,1:39:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 算了 已经没有时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, forget it. We don't have enough time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.05,1:39:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你能反打一下左勾拳吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I said to un-punch someone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.62,1:39:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本没法打\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.53,1:39:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎登机 弹力女超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard, Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.06,1:39:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我们现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although we haven't yet reached{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.76,1:39:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有达到巡航高度\N{\fnArial\fs30}our cruising altitude…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.63,1:39:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在机舱内自由活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}feel free to roam about the cabin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.00,1:39:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or just relax…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.67,1:40:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让机舱在你身边翻滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let the cabin roam about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.59,1:40:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进不了引擎室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get to the engine room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.59,1:40:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总得想出个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.99,1:40:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为船已经不能减速了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because trying to slow it down ain't working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.66,1:40:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们让船转向呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What about turning the boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.59,1:40:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,船的方向杆已经毁掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The steering's been destroyed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.79,1:40:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小飞是说 从外面转弯 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dash means from the outside! - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.60,1:40:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要折断水翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we break off one of the foils{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.70,1:40:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,再使劲转动船舵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turn the rudder…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.87,1:40:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,正义号就不会撞上岸边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can veer the ship away from the city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.24,1:40:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这办法也许有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That might work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.70,1:40:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去推船头 你去推船尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll turn the front, you turn the rear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.84,1:40:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,转动船舵 那可是在水下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using the rudder? That's underwater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.94,1:40:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又怎么才能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to get…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.21,1:40:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 跟我过来孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on, kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.11,1:40:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我知道这办法能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I know this is going to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.15,1:40:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是万一不成功 船撞上岸边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it doesn't, and we crash…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.68,1:40:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的防护罩比船体更坚固\N{\fnArial\fs30}my shields are probably better protection than the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.09,1:40:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该留在这 保护好小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should stay here. With Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.29,1:40:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不愧是我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.79,1:40:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住了 鲍勃 我们两个都往右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, Bob, we're both turning right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.90,1:41:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还挺难过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's sad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.17,1:41:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是不是因为你的理想信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it weren't for your core beliefs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.08,1:41:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许还会成为好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we could have been good friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.81,1:41:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.72,1:41:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有理想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have core beliefs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.19,1:41:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有突发新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have breaking news…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.65,1:41:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我们还没有收到相应的视频信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}While there is still no radio contact, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.79,1:41:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,正义号已经转向\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ship has changed direction…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.33,1:41:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,用最快的速度朝着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is heading towards land{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.63,1:41:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市海岸行驶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a high rate of speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.27,1:41:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dash…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.94,1:41:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 现在下去找船舵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to the rudder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.40,1:41:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮船一旦转向 你就按下按钮 把我拉上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once I turn the ship, you hit the pull up button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.71,1:41:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 爸爸 - 现在放我下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, Dad. - Now lower me down…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.81,1:41:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们超人的好名声 已经毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reputations of superheroes are ruined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.12,1:41:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们永远不能再合法化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never become legal. Ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.06,1:41:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.29,1:41:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.86,1:41:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ever? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.93,1:41:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,连一点点机会都没有么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a little smidgee-widgee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.23,1:41:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你缺氧了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hypoxia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.70,1:42:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你的氧气不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you don't have enough oxygen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.33,1:42:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界就显得特别的傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}things seem really silly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.94,1:42:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界变的越来越傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things get sillier{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.01,1:42:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sillier and then you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.12,1:42:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不想死 不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.08,1:42:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 没人想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, nobody does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.79,1:42:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.02,1:42:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢死也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not such a bad way to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.08,1:42:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人 请你们马上到船尾去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, we need to get to the back of the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.18,1:42:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有超人 保护好大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}All supers, protect your ambassadors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.75,1:42:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.09,1:42:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸下去的时间太长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's been underwater for too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.33,1:43:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把他拉下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta pull him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.97,1:43:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 现在还太早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. It's too soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.45,1:43:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要按下按钮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna press the button!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.08,1:43:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.97,1:43:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,船头动了 成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's turning. It's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.51,1:43:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 - 小飞 快按\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now! - Dash, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.81,1:43:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快变成降落伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save yourself. Make a chute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.52,1:43:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快变 快变 快变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a chute. Make a chute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.55,1:43:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成降落伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a chute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.29,1:43:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷莉 站稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helen! Brace yourselves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.47,1:44:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要撞上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crash positions!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.06,1:44:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我居然没有看到小杰的第一种超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed Jack-Jack's first power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.26,1:44:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你已经错过了十七种了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, you missed the first 17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.24,1:44:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你出手救了我 也不能证明你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact that you saved me doesn't make you right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.91,1:44:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但至少现在你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it does make you alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.88,1:44:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此我也十分感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm grateful for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.85,1:44:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾 不过她要进监狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but she'll go to prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.89,1:45:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很遗憾 她那么有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry she's rich{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.53,1:45:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概费不了多大的劲就能出狱了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will probably get no more than a slap on the wrist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.89,1:45:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 巴小倩 我很喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, Violet, I like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.50,1:45:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 谁知道未来还会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who knows what the future may bring…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.37,1:45:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我对你们大家都有很好的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have a good feeling about all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.14,1:45:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼 好的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Good feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.61,1:45:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道将来会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we be worried?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.37,1:45:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们站下一班岗 我去休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys got the next shift. I'm beat. Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.14,1:45:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了你刚才的表现 太出色了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw what you did back there. That was incredible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.11,1:45:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想着用双关语来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pun intended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.35,1:45:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我当时揍了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I had to punch you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.65,1:45:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒 去兜风咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby! My sweet ride!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.33,1:45:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于拥有超能力的超人群体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in recognition of the extraordinary service{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.97,1:45:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为社会所做出的杰出贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}they have demonstrated…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.17,1:45:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宣布 现在正式恢复超人和超能力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the legal status of superheroes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.64,1:45:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,合法地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}is hereby restored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.95,1:46:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不认识我 是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.95,1:46:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.32,1:46:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.49,1:46:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是餐厅里呛水的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the girl with the water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.59,1:46:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫巴小倩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Violet Parr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.10,1:46:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫托尼 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Tony. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.63,1:46:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你分成几个组之类的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You split up into separate groups and stuff…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.58,1:46:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼 这是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony, this is my mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.98,1:46:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleased to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.18,1:46:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我爸爸 - 你好 我们见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is my dad. - Oh, we've met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.21,1:46:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是很尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is embarrassing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.28,1:46:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很帅气吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charmed, I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.55,1:46:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我弟弟 小飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}My little brother, Dash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.72,1:46:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面的小朋友 是我弟弟小杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the baby is Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.96,1:46:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经努力劝说他们只来一个人就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to limit it to one parent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.99,1:46:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正好都要去看电影 托尼 不用在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all going to a movie, too, Tony. Don't mind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.66,1:46:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be sitting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.96,1:46:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在电影院的另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the other side of the theater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.13,1:46:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会打扰你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not watching you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.67,1:46:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是说着玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.60,1:46:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是开车送我们到电影院门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are only dropping us off at the theater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.71,1:46:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来他们还有别的事要忙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have other things to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.44,1:46:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们家人关系很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you guys are close, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.18,1:46:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 是这样 - 也许你能加入我们大家一起更亲密呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I guess. - We can get closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.55,1:46:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.56,1:47:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车 让我们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Let us out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.73,1:47:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要大份爆米花 小份汽水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, large popcorn, small soda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.40,1:47:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,买中间位置 最好倒数第八排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save me a seat, center, about eight rows back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.14,1:47:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,片头广告结束之前我就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back before the previews are over.{\r}
